#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), and install pantoken's\nagent assets (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) into the same directory."
msgstr "Cruthaigh tionscadal tosaigh do ardán (trí `@pantoken/scaffold`), agus suiteáil sócmhainní ghníomhaire pantoken (trí [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) sa fhillteán céanna."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."
msgstr "Cineál: [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the scaffold's template files."
msgstr "An fillteán sprioc (réamhshocraithe `\".\"`). Is ionadaítear a ainm bhun (nó `\"pantoken-app\"` do `\".\"`) le `{{projectName}}` i gcomhaid teimpléid an scaffold."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### tool?"
msgstr "### tool?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which agent tool's assets to install alongside the scaffold (default `\"all\"`)."
msgstr "Cén sócmhainn uirlis ghníomhaire atá le suiteáil in aice leis an scaffold (réamhshocraithe `\"all\"`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written, scaffold files first."
msgstr "Na cosáin a scríobhtar, comhaid scaffold ar dtús."

