#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: scaffoldProject()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: scaffoldProject()"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "Struchtúr tosaigh don tionscadal ar ardán a bhunú, le pantoken suiteáilte agus ceangailte cheana."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "An eolaire sprioc (réamhshocraithe `\".\"`). Is ionadófar a bhun-ainm (nó `\"pantoken-app\"` do `\".\"`)\n  le `{{projectName}}` i gcomhaid teimpléid."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### options?"
msgstr "### options?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` roghnaíonn cé na comhaid scátháin bileog chomhartha `@pantoken/css` a iompófar (réamhshocraithe `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), curtha i bhfeidhm ar gach ardán. Roghnaíonn `cdn` an t‑soláthraí CDN; `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` a tógadh dó (réamhshocraithe jsDelivr);\n  neamhairdítear iad ag gach ardán eile."

