msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/next` — a Next.js config adapter."
msgstr "`@pantoken/next` — oiriúnóir cumraíochta Next.js."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure UI ships ESM packages that Next must transpile (`transpilePackages`), the #1 papercut\nwhen running InstUI on Next. `withPantoken` merges the InstUI packages into that list. Wrap your\n`next.config`, then import `@pantoken/css` in your root layout for the tokens."
msgstr "Seolann Instructure UI pacáistí ESM a gcaithfidh Next a thrasfhoilsiú (`transpilePackages`), an fhadhb bheag is mó nuair a rithtear InstUI ar Next. Déanann `withPantoken` comhiomlán ar phacáistí InstUI isteach sa liosta sin. Timpeall do `next.config`, ansin allmhairigh `@pantoken/css` i do leagan fréime chun na tóicíní."

