msgid "Swap the default `info` glyph for an icon from the shared icon set (for example, `-icon-megaphone`)."
msgstr "Malartaigh an ghiolalf `info` réamhshocraithe le h-íomhán as an tacar íomhán comhroinnte (mar shampla, `-icon-megaphone`)."

