msgstr "`li` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Brotán (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), `<li>` i `<ol>` an thuismitheora; is é an ceann deiridh an leathanach reatha."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
