#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: button"
msgstr "# CSS: cnaipe"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr ".instui-button — Rialú gníomhaíochta inrochtana, stíleáilte ó pháiléad na dtóicní; príomhúil de réir réamhshocraithe."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's `.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."
msgstr "Cuireann éagsúlachtaí AI dhá chéimdhath ar a fráma — líonadh padding-box agus stóc border-box — agus ní féidir le `-color-ai-secondary` téacs céimdhathaithe agus líonadh a phéinteáil ag an am céanna, mar sin fanann a lár trédhearcach ag sos agus líonann sé ar hover nó nuair atá sé gníomhach. Sa stát hover agus gníomhach, faigheann `-without-background` níochán branda ísealtrédhearcachta beagán dorchaithe in ionad na tóicíní hover-background amh (a bheadh ag cló téacs ar an dath céanna ar chúlra den dath céanna). Socraíonn sé a `gap` do shiombail/lipéad agus `padding` cothrománach; cuireann módhnóir spásála `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` thar na luachanna ionsuite. Tá an clúdach roghnach `.instui-button-group` mar léiriú ar `.buttonGroup` i Figma agus tá sé freagrach as an spásáil idir na cnaipí in aice."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drive the `-toggle` variant's pressed state with `aria-pressed`, and mark a disabled button with `aria-disabled` (or the native `disabled`)."
msgstr "Bain úsáid as `aria-pressed` chun staid brúite an athraitheora `-toggle` a thiomáint, agus marcáil cnaipe atá dífheidhmithe le `aria-disabled` (nó leis an `disabled` dúchais)."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A group wrapper lays out adjacent buttons with the shared button gap."
msgstr "Cuimsitheoir grúpa socraíonn sé cnaipeacha in aice lena chéile leis an eatramh cnaipe comhroinnte."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An AI action."
msgstr "Gníomhaíocht AI."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A lower-emphasis AI action."
msgstr "Gníomh AI le béim íseal."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A destructive action."
msgstr "Gníomh scriosach."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) the primary action."
msgstr "(réamhshocraithe) an phríomhghníomh."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-on-color`."
msgstr "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Ní mholtar é</span> — bain úsáid as `.-on-color`."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A lower-emphasis secondary action."
msgstr "Gníomhaíocht tánaisteach le béim níos ísle."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A positive/confirming action."
msgstr "Gníomh dearfach/dearbhaithe"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A text-style action (no fill or border until hover)."
msgstr "Gníomh stíl-théacs (gan líonadh ná teorainn go dtí go mbíonn an luch os cionn)"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter padding for dense toolbars."
msgstr "Spásáil níos daingeanaí do bharraí uirlisí dlúth."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full-width block button."
msgstr "Cnaipe bloc le leithead iomlán."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-color-tertiary`."
msgstr "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">I léig</span> — bain úsáid as `.-color-tertiary`."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a glyph from the icon set before the label (e.g. `-icon-arrow-right`), painted in the button's text colour; pair with `-shape-square`/`-shape-circle` for an icon-only button."
msgstr "Taispeáin glyf ón tsraith íomhán roimh an lipéad (m.sh. `-icon-arrow-right`), péinteáilte i ndath téacs an chnaipe; péireáil le `-shape-square`/`-shape-circle` chun cnaipe a bheith le híocón amháin."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For a button placed on a coloured (non-neutral) surface. Composed with `-color-primary` (default) fills white with dark text; composed with `-color-secondary` stays transparent with a white border and text."
msgstr "Le haghaidh cnaipe ar dhromchla daite (neamh‑neodrach). Nuair a chomhcheangal le `-color-primary` (réamhshocrú) líontar é i ndearg bán le téacs dorcha; nuair a chomhcheangal le `-color-secondary` fanann sé trédhearcach le teorainn bhán agus téacs bán."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A round icon button."
msgstr "Cnaipe deilbhín cruinn."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A square icon button."
msgstr "Cnaipe deilbhín cearnógach."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) medium size."
msgstr "(réamhshocraithe) méid mheánach."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) medium size. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "(réamhshocraithe) meánmhéid. Ailias fhada de `-size-md`."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pressed-state toggle button (drive with aria-pressed)."
msgstr "Cnaipe lasc i staid bhrúite (rialú le aria-pressed)."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drop the fill (ghost)."
msgstr "Scaoil an líon (taibhsí)."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove the border."
msgstr "Bain an teorainn."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI-secondary gradient border ring, masked to just the button's frame."
msgstr "Fáinne teorann grádáin AI-thánaisteach, mascáilte chun fráma an chnaipe amháin."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI glyph, added automatically to AI buttons and masked in the variant's own colour."
msgstr "An siombail AI, curtha go huathoibríoch ar chnaipeanna AI agus daite i ndath féin an leagain."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [close-button](/api/css/close-button.md) — The icon-only dismiss button."
msgstr "- [close-button](/api/css/close-button.md) — An cnaipe dúnta le híocón amháin."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: byline"
msgstr ""

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-byline` — A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "`.instui-byline` — Réad meán: figiúr laoch in aice le teideal agus cur síos."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the figure and the text block; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé a `gap` féin idir an fhigiúir agus an bloc téacs; sáróidh modhnóir spáis `-gap-*` nasctha an luach ionsuite sin."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [byline.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/byline/byline.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [byline.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/byline/byline.css)"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Vertically centre the text beside the hero."
msgstr "Lárigh an téacs go hingearach in aice leis an laoch."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align the text to the top of the hero."
msgstr "Ailínigh an téacs ag barr an laoch."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a leading glyph icon before the text block."
msgstr "Taispeáin siombail ghrafaic thosaigh roimh an bloc téacs."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium."
msgstr "Meánach."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "Meánach. Ailias fhada de `-size-md`."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The supporting body text."
msgstr "An téacs coirp tacaíochta."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The heading text."
msgstr "An téacs ceannlíne."

#: css/calendar.day.md
#, no-c-format
