msgid "# CSS: calendar.day"
msgstr ""

#: css/calendar.day.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.day` — A day cell (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected`, and `-outside-month` mark its state."
msgstr "`.day` — Ceall lae (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); léiríonn `-today`, `-selected` agus `-outside-month` a stádas."

#: css/calendar.day.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A day from the adjacent month (leading/trailing filler)."
msgstr "Lá ón mhí in aice (líonadh tosaigh/deiridh)."

#: css/calendar.day.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The selected date."
msgstr "An dáta roghnaithe."

#: css/calendar.day.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Today's date."
msgstr "Dáta an lae inniu."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: calendar"
msgstr ""

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-calendar` — A static month grid with navigation, weekday headers, and day cells."
msgstr "`.instui-calendar` — Gríd mhí statach le nascleanúint, ceannlíne laethanta seachtaine, agus cillí laethanta."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `calendar.day` member for the individual day cells."
msgstr "Féach an bhall `calendar.day` do na cillí laethanta aonair."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [calendar.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/calendar/calendar.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [calendar.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/calendar/calendar.css)"

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Expose the grid with `role=\"table\"` and a descriptive `aria-label`, and give each navigation button its own `aria-label`."
msgstr "Nocht an gríd le `role=\"table\"` agus `aria-label` cur síosach, agus tabhair `aria-label` féin do gach cnaipe nascleanúna."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The seven-column day grid."
msgstr "An gríd laethanta le seacht gcolún."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The month navigation row."
msgstr "An sraith nascleanúna míosúil."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A weekday column header."
msgstr "Ceannlíne colúin lae seachtaine."

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: callout"
msgstr ""

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-callout\"]` — Inline information alert for a short reminder or note."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-callout\"]` — Fógra faisnéise líne-isteach le haghaidh meabhrúcháin nó nóta gairid."

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Callout when:"
msgstr "✅ Úsáid Callout nuair a:"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need to highlight important information or reminders inline\n- The message is relatively brief (a sentence to a short paragraph)\n- The alert should draw attention without interrupting the main flow\n🚫 Don't use Callout when:"
msgstr "- Ní mór duit faisnéis thábhachtach nó meabhruithe a ghéarú líne-isteach\n- Tá an teachtaireacht sách gairid (abairt go mír ghearr)\n- Ba chóir don fógra aird a tharraingt gan an phríomhshruth a chur isteach\n🚫 Ná húsáid Callout nuair a:"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The message requires interaction or multiple actions — use a Modal or Alert Dialog\n- The content is the main focus of the page — use a Card or Hero layout instead"
msgstr "- Éilíonn an teachtaireacht idirghníomhú nó ilghníomhartha — bain úsáid as Modal nó Alert Dialog\n- Is é an t-ábhar príomhfhócas an leathanaigh — bain úsáid as Card nó leagan Hero ina ionad"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure the alert role is properly applied (role=\"alert\" or role=\"status\")\n- Use semantic color contrast that meets WCAG AA standards\n- Don't rely on color alone to convey meaning"
msgstr "- Cinntigh go bhfuil an ról fógra curtha i bhfeidhm i gceart (role=\"alert\" nó role=\"status\")\n- Úsáid codarsnacht dathanna seimeantacha a chomhlíonann caighdeáin WCAG AA\n- Ná muinín a bheith agat as dath amháin chun brí a chur in iúl"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alert message content"
msgstr "Ábhar teachtaireachta an fhógra"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for the text content."
msgstr "Coimeádán don ábhar téacs."

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional icon to the left of the content."
msgstr "Siombail roghnach ar chlé den ábhar."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: card"
msgstr ""

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-card` — A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."
msgstr "`.instui-card` — Coimeádán dromchla a ghlacann ábhar ar bith."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Variant** controls how direct children are styled: `content` (default) leaves them\n  unstyled; `container` stacks them as bordered, padded sections. Padding scales with\n  viewport width and is the same across both variants.\n  **Size** is fully responsive — padding and border-radius step up automatically at 320px\n  (20rem) and 640px (40rem) via standard `min-width` media queries; no size class is needed.\n  Pair with `@pantoken/components` for heading, button, and other inline components."
msgstr "**Eagsúlacht** rialálann conas a stílaítear na páistí díreacha: fágann `content` (réamhshocrú) iad gan stíl; cuireann `container` iad i sraitheanna mar réigiúin le teorainn agus padáil. Méadaíonn an padáil de réir leithead an radhairc agus tá sé mar an gcéanna sna dhá eagsúlacht. Tá an **Méid** go hiomlán freagartha — ardaíonn an padáil agus radius na teorann go huathoibríoch ag 320px (20rem) agus 640px (40rem) trí cheangail mheánchaighdeánacha `min-width`; níl aon rangmhéid riachtanach. Páirigh le `@pantoken/components` do theideal, cnaipe, agus comhpháirteanna inline eile."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Use `<article>` as the card element when the card is a self-contained unit of content;\n  use `<section>` when grouped within a larger landmark. In `-variant-container`, prefer\n  `<section>` elements as direct children so each bordered region carries semantic meaning."
msgstr "Bain úsáid as `<article>` mar eilimint chárta nuair is aonad ábhair féinchoinníollach í an cárta; bain úsáid as `<section>` nuair atá sé ghrúpáilte laistigh de réigiún tábhachtach níos mó. I `-variant-container`, roghnaigh eilimintí `<section>` mar pháistí díreacha ionas go mbeidh brí shéimeantach ag gach réigiún le teorainn."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Content card -nocard"
msgstr "Cárta ábhair -nocard"

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container card -nocard"
msgstr "Cárta coimeádáin -nocard"

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container card; direct children become bordered, padded sections."
msgstr "Cárta coimeádáin; éireoidh na páistí díreacha mar réigiúin le teorainn agus padáil."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standard content card; children are unstyled. Default when no variant is set."
msgstr "Cárta ábhair caighdeánach; níl stíl ar na páistí. Réamhshocrú nuair nach bhfuil eagsúlacht socraithe."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `@scope` is Baseline 2023 Newly Available; the card degrades to an unscoped flat stylesheet\n  in older browsers with no loss of visible styling."
msgstr "- Tá `@scope` ar fáil mar Bhunlíne 2023; ísíonn an cárta go stíleolaí réidh neamh-scóipáilte i mbrausair níos sine gan cailliúint i stíliú infheicthe."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [heading](/api/css/heading.md) — Place directly in the card or inside a container section.\n- [button](/api/css/button.md) — Place directly in the card or inside a container section.\n- [img](/api/css/img.md) — Place directly in the card as a media region.\n- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — Place directly in the card as a status indicator."
msgstr "- [heading](/api/css/heading.md) — Cuir go díreach sa chárta nó laistigh de rannán coimeádáin.\n- [button](/api/css/button.md) — Cuir go díreach sa chárta nó laistigh de rannán coimeádáin.\n- [img](/api/css/img.md) — Cuir go díreach sa chárta mar réigiún mheán.\n- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — Cuir go díreach sa chárta mar tháscaire stádais."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade-6/#scoping"
msgstr "- https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade-6/#scoping"

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: checkbox"
msgstr ""

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-checkbox` — A native checkbox and its label, or a switch via `-variant-toggle`."
msgstr "`.instui-checkbox` — bosca seiceála dúchais agus a lipéad, nó lasc trí `-variant-toggle`."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set `el.indeterminate = true` in JavaScript to show the mixed-state dash; the checked tick auto-contrasts against the fill — white on a dark fill, near-black on a light one. Also sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Socraigh `el.indeterminate = true` i JavaScript chun an dash stáit-mheasctha a thaispeáint; déanann an marc seiceála seiceáilte coincréitfhánaíocht go huathoibríoch in aghaidh an líonta — bán ar líontán dorcha, beagnach dubh ar líontán éadrom. Socraíonn sé freisin a `gap` idir an rialtóir agus a lipéad; má dhéantar slabhra le modhnóir spáis `-gap-*` cuirtear an luach ionsuite sin ar ceal."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [checkbox.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/checkbox/checkbox.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [checkbox.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/checkbox/checkbox.css)"

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native `<input type=\"checkbox\">` drives `:checked`, `:indeterminate`, and `:disabled`; set `el.indeterminate = true` in JavaScript for the mixed state, and note that `-readonly` is styling only since checkboxes have no native readonly attribute."
msgstr "Tiomáineann `<input type=\"checkbox\">` dúchais `:checked`, `:indeterminate`, agus `:disabled`; socraigh `el.indeterminate = true` i JavaScript don stáit mheasctha, agus tabhair faoi deara go bhfuil `-readonly` stíleáil amháin ós rud é nach bhfuil aon airíonna readonly dúchasacha ag boscaí seiceála."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Invalid (error) state."
msgstr "Stáit neamhdhleathach (earráid)."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the label after the control."
msgstr "Cuir an lipéad i ndiaidh an rialaithe."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the label before the control."
msgstr "Cuir an lipéad roimh an rialtóir."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the label above the control."
msgstr "Cuir an lipéad os cionn an rialaithe."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read-only state."
msgstr "Stáit léamh-aon."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Show the required-field asterisk next to the label."
msgstr "Taispeáin réaltaire réimse-riachtanach gar do lipéad."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render as a switch instead of a box."
msgstr "Líon mar lasc in ionad bosca."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The required-field asterisk."
msgstr "An réaltaire réimse-riachtanach."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On `-variant-toggle`, the state glyph riding the handle: an X when off, a check when on."
msgstr "Ar `-variant-toggle`, an glyf stáit ar an láimhseáil: X nuair atá sé as, marc seiceála nuair atá sé ar."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The masked tick or dash glyph centered in the box; on `-variant-toggle` it becomes the sliding handle instead."
msgstr "An marc seiceála nó glyf dash maisctha lárnach sa bhosca; ar `-variant-toggle` é a bheith ina láimhseáil sleamhnáin ina ionad."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The box's mask glyph: a tick when checked, a dash when indeterminate."
msgstr "Glyf maisc an bhosca: marc seiceála nuair atá sé seiceáilte, dash nuair atá sé indeterminate."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle border width."
msgstr "Leithead na teorann don lasc."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle switch height."
msgstr "Airde an lasc."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The computed handle diameter."
msgstr "Diaméadar an láimhseáil reatha (computed)."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The handle inset from each track edge."
msgstr "An instealladh láimhseála ón iarlíne i ngach imeall rian."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle track width."
msgstr "Leithead an rian lasc."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — The single-select counterpart."
msgstr "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — An comhghlacadóir roghnaigh-aon."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: close-button"
msgstr ""

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-close-button` — A transparent icon button that draws its own × glyph, in three sizes plus an on-color variant."
msgstr "`.instui-close-button` — cnaipe deilbhín trédhearcach a tharraingíonn a ghilf × féin, i dtrí mhéid agus le athróg ar-dath."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Always renders as an icon-only control with no visible label, so an `aria-label` is required, not optional; compare to `button`'s `-without-background` ghost variant, which keeps a text label."
msgstr "I gcónaí taispeántar mar smacht deilbhín-amháin gan lipéad infheicthe, mar sin tá `aria-label` riachtanach, ní roghnach; déan comparáid leis an athróg ‘ghost’ `-without-background` de `button`, a choinníonn lipéad téacs."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [close-button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/close-button/close-button.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [close-button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/close-button/close-button.css)"

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the icon-only button an `aria-label` (e.g. \"Close\"), and mark a disabled button with `aria-disabled` (or the native `disabled`)."
msgstr "Tabhair `aria-label` don chnaipe deilbhín-amháin (m.sh. \"Close\"), agus marcáil cnaipe faoi mhíchumas le `aria-disabled` (nó leis an `disabled` dúchasach)."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For a close button placed on a coloured (non-neutral) surface."
msgstr "Le haghaidh cnaipe dúnta suite ar dromchla datha (nach bhfuil neodrach)."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The × glyph, masked in `currentColor`."
msgstr "An gilf ×, mascáilte i `currentColor`."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [button](/api/css/button.md) — The general-purpose action button."
msgstr "- [button](/api/css/button.md) — An cnaipe gníomhaíochta chuspóra ginearálta."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: color"
msgstr ""

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--text-danger` — Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr "`.--text-danger` — Uirlisí dathanna shéimeantacha: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (a bhfuil ailias air mar `.--color-<name>`), agus `.--border-<name>` don phailéad shéimeantach curtha le chéile. Tá ailias modhnóra ceangailte le comhpháirt ag gach ceann acu freisin (mar shampla `-bg-danger` ar aon `.instui-<component>`)."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [generate.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/scripts/generate.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [generate.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/scripts/generate.ts)"

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies the semantic danger text colour."
msgstr "Cuireann sé dath téacs contúirte shéimeantach i bhfeidhm."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Background colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names."
msgstr "Uirlisí datha cúlra do ainmneacha shéimeantacha agus ainmneacha ailínithe le comhpháirteanna."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Border colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names."
msgstr "Uirlisí datha teorainn do ainmneacha shéimeantacha agus ainmneacha ailínithe le comhpháirteanna."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--text-*` for text colour utilities."
msgstr "Ailias de `--text-*` do uirlisí dath téacs."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names."
msgstr "Uirlisí dath téacs do ainmneacha shéimeantacha agus ainmneacha ailínithe le comhpháirteanna."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: context-view"
msgstr ""

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-context-view` — An elevated callout with a caret, positionable on any side; works as a native `[popover]`."
msgstr "`.instui-context-view` — Fógra uasghrádaithe le caret, is féidir é a shuíomh ar aon taobh; oibríonn sé mar `[popover]` dúchais."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The caret is two stacked `::before`/`::after` triangles (border then fill) so it reads correctly against a matching surface; as a `[popover]` it needs the same open/`popovertarget` wiring as `popover`, but unlike `tooltip`, it dismisses on outside click or Escape."
msgstr "Tá an caret comhdhéanta de dhá thríúir `::before`/`::after`stackáilte (teorainn ansin líon) ionas go léifidh sé i gceart i gcoinne dromchla comhfhiatal; mar `[popover]` tá an samaosc oscailte/`popovertarget` riachtanach aige mar `popover`, ach murab ionann agus `tooltip`, dúnann sé nuair a chliceálann an taobh amuigh nó nuair a bhrúnn Escape."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [context-view.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/context-view/context-view.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [context-view.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/context-view/context-view.css)"

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dark (inverse) colour scheme."
msgstr "Scéim dhatha dorcha (inbhéartaithe)."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit below the anchor."
msgstr "Suíonn thíos faoin ancaire."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit at the end (inline-end) of the anchor."
msgstr "Suíonn ag an deireadh (inline-end) den ancaire."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit at the start (inline-start) of the anchor."
msgstr "Suíonn ag an tús (inline-start) den ancaire."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit above the anchor."
msgstr "Suíonn os cionn an ancaire."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the caret's inner fill triangle."
msgstr "Rinneann sé an triantán líonta inmheánach den caret a léiriú."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the caret's outer border triangle."
msgstr "Rinneann sé an triantán teorann seachtrach den caret a léiriú."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Uses CSS anchor positioning (`position-anchor`, `position-area`, `position-try-fallbacks`) and the native `[popover]` API behind an `@supports` guard; needs a recent Chromium or Safari, and falls back to a UA-centred popover elsewhere."
msgstr "- Úsáideann sé suíomh ancaire CSS (`position-anchor`, `position-area`, `position-try-fallbacks`) agus an API dúchais `[popover]` taobh thiar de garda `@supports`; teastaíonn Chromium nó Safari le déanaí, agus i gcás eile téann sé ar ais chuig popover lárnach don UA."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer popover.\n- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — A smaller hover or focus callout."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — An popover ginearálta sraithe uachtair.\n- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — Fógra níos lú le haghaidh hover nó fócas."

#: css/cursor.md
#, no-c-format
