#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"
msgstr "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.content` — The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "`.content` — Príomhphána ábhar a líonann an spás atá fágtha taobh den tráid."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Once the parent's inline-size drops below `46em` (`16em` tray width + `30em` breakpoint), a `@container` query on the parent's `pantoken-drawer-layout` container drops this member's `min-inline-size` to `0` automatically, matching the manual `[should-overlay-tray]` override."
msgstr "Nuair a thiteann méid-inline an tuismitheora faoi `46em` (leithead an tráid `16em` + pointe-briseadh `30em`), laghdaíonn fiosrúchán `@container` ar choimeádán `pantoken-drawer-layout` an tuismitheora `min-inline-size` an bhall seo go `0` go huathoibríoch, ag teacht le breisú láimhe `[should-overlay-tray]`."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Carry `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "Bain úsáid as `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) agus ainmníocht é le `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` nuair nach n-aithnítear é trí chomhthéacs amháin."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.tray](/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.tray](/ga/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-drawer-layout` — A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "`.instui-drawer-layout` — Leagan amach roinnte le tráid taobh inchoigeartaithe agus painéal ábhair príomhúil is féidir a scriobhú (scroll)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-placement-end` and the default (start) both use `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` logical properties, not `left`/`right`, so the tray's side follows `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` automatically — no separate RTL rules are needed."
msgstr "`-placement-end` agus an réamhshocrú (tús) úsáideann an dá `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` maoin loighciúla, ní `left`/`right`, mar sin leanann taobh an tráid `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` go huathoibríoch — níl riail RTL ar leith ag teastáil."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When the tray acts as navigation, label it with an accessible heading or `aria-label`. Give `.content` `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "Nuair a bhíonn an tráid mar nascleanúint, lipéadaigh é le ceannacht inacmhainne nó le `aria-label`. Tabhair do `.content` `role=\"region\"` (réamh-nós DrawerLayout InstUI) agus ainmniu é le `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` nuair nach ndéantar é a aithint go soiléir ón gcomhthéacs amháin."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Show the tray even when the `open` attribute is absent."
msgstr "Taispeáin an tráid fiú nuair nach bhfuil an tréith `open` i láthair."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-end side."
msgstr "Socrú an tráid ar an taobh deiridh inlíne."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-start side (the default; sets it explicitly)."
msgstr "Socrú an tráid ar an taobh tosaigh inlíne (réamhshocrú; socraíonn sé é go sainráite)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Render the tray as an overlay instead of shrinking content inline."
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The main pane."
msgstr "An phríomh-phainéal."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel."
msgstr "An painéal taobh."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Width threshold for overlay mode (`30em`, themed via responsive utilities)."
msgstr "Teorainn leithead don mhód osclaíochta (`30em`, téamáilte trí uirlisí freagartha)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` members switch to overlay mode automatically via a `@container` query once this element's inline-size drops below tray-width + `--pantoken-bp-md`. The `@pantoken/interactions` behavior additionally toggles `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (a manual override) and emits `overlaytraychange` for apps that need the change as an event."
msgstr "- Athraíonn baill `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` go huathoibríoch go dtí an mód osclaíochta trí cheist `@container` nuair a thiteann méid inlíne an eilimint seo faoi leithead an tráid + `--pantoken-bp-md`. Ina theannta sin, déanann iompar `@pantoken/interactions` comhroghnú `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (srianta láimhe) agus gintear `overlaytraychange` do aipeanna a bhfuil gá acu an t-athrú sin a fháil mar imeacht."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A standalone edge overlay; this layout keeps tray and content in the same flow.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A smaller anchored surface for contextual actions and detail."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — Osclaíthaipe teorann neamhspleách; coinníonn an leagan amach seo an tráid agus an t-ábhar sa sreabhadh céanna.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Dromchla anchrach níos lú le gníomhartha comhthéacsacha agus le sonraí."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tray` — The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "`.tray` — An painéal taobh in aice leis an bpríomh-ábhar, le rogha cur i bhfeidhm os cionn agus modhnóirí dromchla cosúil le tráid."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Positioning uses `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (never `left`/`right`), so `-placement-end` docks to the true trailing edge in both LTR and RTL."
msgstr "Úsáideann suíomh `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (ní riamh `left`/`right`), mar sin tá `-placement-end` daingnithe ag an imeall dheireanach i LTR agus RTL."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "If used as navigation, wrap links in a semantic `<nav>` and provide an accessible name."
msgstr "Má úsáidtear mar nascleanúint, fill na naisc i `<nav>` shéamanta agus cuir ainm inacmhainne leo."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock this tray to inline-end when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "Daingnigh an tráid seo ag an deireadh inlíne nuair atá mód os cionn gníomhach."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove the panel edge border."
msgstr "Bain teorann imeall an phainéil."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove elevation when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "Bain an ardú nuair atá mód os cionn gníomhach."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — The primary pane that flexes alongside this member."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — An príomh-phána a athraíonn go solúbtha in aice leis an mball seo."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: file-drop"
msgstr ""

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-file-drop` — A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "`.instui-file-drop` — Limistéar scaoilte comhad le stádas sleamhnaithe, glacaithe agus diúltaithe."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` classes are purely visual — actual drag-and-drop detection and file validation are the consumer's JS to wire up around the wrapped native input."
msgstr "Tá na ranganna `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` go hiomlán amhairc — is le JS an tomhaltóra an braiteadh tarraing-agus-scaoileadh iarbhír agus an bailíochtú comhaid a shocrú timpeall ar an ionchur dúchais atá fillte."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap a native `<input type=\"file\">` in the `<label>` drop zone so it stays a real, labelled file control that the keyboard and assistive tech can operate."
msgstr "Fill an `<input type=\"file\">` dúchais i limistéar scaoilte `<label>` ionas go mairfidh sé mar rialtán comhad fíor, lipéadaithe gur féidir an méarchlár agus teicneolaíochtaí cúnta a oibriú."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for an acceptable file."
msgstr "Stádas tarraingthe do chomhad inghlactha."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hover or drag-over state."
msgstr "Stádas sleamhnithe nó tarraing-thar."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render the leading dropzone glyph icon."
msgstr "Rindreáil an tsiombail glyf tosaigh don limistéar scaoilte."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for a rejected file."
msgstr "Stádas tarraingthe do chomhad diúltaithe."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-group` — A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-group` — Grúpa `<fieldset>` le finscéal, le leagan colún nó líneach, agus le spásáil inchoigeartaithe."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between fields, tunable with the `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` modifiers below — prefer those over chaining a generic `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier, which overrides the built-in value outright."
msgstr "Socraíonn a `gap` féin idir na réimsí, inchoigeartaithe leis na modhnóirí `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` thíos — is fearr iad sin ná slabhraú le modhnóir úsáideora spáis ghinearálta `-gap-*`, a sháraíonn an luach ionsuite go hiomlán."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>`, so the legend text names the whole group for assistive tech."
msgstr "Líonann sé `<fieldset>` dúchais le `<legend>`, ionas go n-ainmníonn téacs an finscéil an grúpa iomlán do theicneolaíochtaí cúnamh."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large column gap."
msgstr "Bearna colún mhór."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium column gap."
msgstr "Bearna colún mheánach."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No column gap."
msgstr "Gan bearna colún."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small column gap."
msgstr "Bearna colún bheag."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align child fields to a shared grid."
msgstr "Déan réimsí leanaí a ailíniú le greid roinnte."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields out in columns."
msgstr "Socraigh réimsí leanaí i gcolúin."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields inline, in a row."
msgstr "Socraigh réimsí leanaí líneáilte, i sraith."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the group as required."
msgstr "Marcáil an grúpa mar riachtanach."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large row gap."
msgstr "Bearna sraithe mhór."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium row gap."
msgstr "Bearna sraithe mheánach."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No row gap."
msgstr "Gan bearna sraithe."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small row gap."
msgstr "Bearna sraithe bheag."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the fields."
msgstr "Ailínigh na réimsí ag bun."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Middle-align the fields."
msgstr "Ailínigh na réimsí sa lár."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the fields."
msgstr "Ailínigh na réimsí ag barr."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the legend text when the group is required."
msgstr "Taispeánann sé an réalta maisiúil réimse‑riachtanach tar éis téacs an finscéil nuair atá an grúpa riachtanach."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `-layout-aligned` mode uses CSS subgrid behind an `@supports` guard; where subgrid is unsupported, the fields fall back to their own stacked layout."
msgstr "- Úsáideann an mhodh `-layout-aligned` subgrid CSS faoi chosaint `@supports`; nuair nach dtacaítear le subgrid, filleann na réimsí ar a leagan féin stacáilte."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — The single field this group repeats.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Groups radio inputs under a legend."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — An t‑aon réimse a athfháiltíonn an grúpa seo.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Grúpálann ionchuir raidió faoi fhinscéal."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-messages"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Cabhair réimse agus teachtaireachtaí fíoraithe — leid, earráid, rath, agus amháin do léitheoir scáileáin — le siombail ar earráid agus ar rath."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between stacked messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé a `gap` féin idir teachtaireachtaí stacáilte; cuireann nascú le modhnóir áise spásála `-gap-*` thar an luach ionsuite sin."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `-type-screenreader-only` message is visually hidden but stays in the accessibility tree, so it's still announced; pair error and success messages with the field via aria-describedby so assistive tech reads them with the control."
msgstr "Tá teachtaireacht `-type-screenreader-only` faoi cheilt go amhairc ach fanann sí sa chrann inrochtaineachta, mar sin fógraítear í fós; péireáil teachtaireachtaí earráide agus ratha leis an réimse trí aria-describedby ionas go léifidh teicneolaíocht chúnamh iad leis an rialtóir."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-type-error`."
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An individual message; its `-type-*` picks the hint, error, success, or screen-reader-only variant."
msgstr "Teachtaireacht aonair; roghnaíonn a `-type-*` an éagsúlacht leid, earráid, rath, nó amháin do léitheoir scáileáin."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the leading status glyph on error and success messages: an alert circle for errors and a check circle for success."
msgstr "Léiríonn sé an tsiombail stádais tosaigh ar theachtaireachtaí earráide agus ratha: ciorcal rabhaidh do earráidí agus ciorcal seiceála le haghaidh ratha."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Wraps a label, controls, and these messages."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Cuimlíonn sé lipéad, rialuithe, agus na teachtaireachtaí seo."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field` — A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field` — Pacáiste réimse foirme: lipéad, a rialuithe, agus leaganacha inlíne, riachtanach, nó léamh-aonair."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An error message stays hidden until the field's control is `:user-invalid` (after the user interacts) or you add the `-invalid` class. Use `-layout-inline` to put the label beside the controls and `-layout-stacked` to put it above. Also sets its own `gap` between the label, controls, and messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Fanann teachtaireacht earráide i bhfolach go dtí go mbeidh rialú an réimse `:user-invalid` (tar éis idirghníomhaíocht an úsáideora) nó go gcuirfidh tú an rang `-invalid` leis. Úsáid `-layout-inline` chun an lipéad a chur cois na rialuithe agus `-layout-stacked` chun é a chur os cionn. Socraíonn sé freisin a `gap` féin idir an lipéad, na rialuithe, agus na teachtaireachtaí; sáraíonn nascáil le hoiriúnóir spásála `-gap-*` an luach tógtha sin."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `<label>` element wraps the control, so the label text names it natively; the required asterisk is decorative and should be hidden from assistive tech (aria-hidden), and the error message surfaces once the control is `:user-invalid` or you add the `-invalid` class."
msgstr "Cuimsíonn eilimint `<label>` an rialú, mar sin tugann téacs an lipéid ainm dó go nadúrtha; is mais é an réalta riachtanach agus ba chóir í a cheilt ó theicneolaíochtaí chúnamh (aria-hidden), agus tagann an teachtaireacht earráide chun solais nuair a bhíonn an rialú `:user-invalid` nó má chuireann tú an rang `-invalid` leis."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout (shorthand for `-layout-inline`)."
msgstr "Leagan inlíne (gairid le haghaidh `-layout-inline`)."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the label text."
msgstr "Déan téacs an lipéid a ailíniú ag an deireadh."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the label text."
msgstr "Déan téacs an lipéid a ailíniú ag an tús."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout: label beside the controls."
msgstr "Leagan inlíne: lipéad cois na rialuithe."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stacked layout: label above the controls."
msgstr "Leagan stacáilte: lipéad os cionn na rialuithe."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "Ailíneáil an lipéid ag bun in éineacht leis na rialuithe."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "Ailíneáil an lipéid ag barr in éineacht leis na rialuithe."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control area beside or below the label."
msgstr "An limistéar rialaithe cois nó faoi bhun an lipéid."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The field label."
msgstr "Lipéad an réimse."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the label text when the field is required."
msgstr "Léiríonn sé an réalta maisithe a shonraíonn réimse riachtanach i ndiaidh téacs an lipéid nuair a éilítear an réimse."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Renders the field's hint, error, and success messages.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Groups related fields under a shared legend."
msgstr "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Léiríonn leid, teachtaireacht earráide, agus teachtaireacht ratha an réimse.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Grúpálann réimsí gaolmhara faoi fhinscéal roinnte."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: gap"
msgstr ""

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--gap-md` — Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "`.--gap-md` — uirlisí `gap` flex/grid ar an scála spáisála, scríobhadh gairid (`--gap-sm`) nó fada (`--gap-small`). Inúsáidte folamh nó slánaithe ar aon chomhpháirt (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — is féidir comhpháirteanna a shocraíonn a `gap` féin ó thicéad sonrach chomhpháirt a shárú."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies the medium spacing token as the gap."
msgstr "Cuirtear an token spáis mheánach i bhfeidhm mar an bearna."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Gap utilities across short and long spacing-step spellings."
msgstr "Uirlisí bearna do scríbhinní céimeanna spáis ghearra agus fhada."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: heading"
msgstr ""

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-heading` — Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "`.instui-heading` — Togra tipagrafach ceannlíne ó `-level-h1` go `-level-h6`."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets override a `-level-*`'s font-size and font-weight, so combine only one of each family per element."
msgstr "Baineann na réamhshocruithe `-variant-*` le méid cló agus meáchan cló de `-level-*`, mar sin comhcheangail ach ceann amháin de gach teaghlach in aghaidh eilimint."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "These classes set the visual level only, so render a real `<h1>`–`<h6>` (or use `role=\"heading\"` with `aria-level`) to convey the heading level."
msgstr "Socraíonn na ranganna seo an leibhéal amhairc amháin, mar sin léirigh `<h1>`–`<h6>` fíor (nó bain úsáid as `role=\"heading\"` le `aria-level`) chun leibhéal na ceannlínte a chur in iúl."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a bottom rule."
msgstr "Cuir riail íochtair leis."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a top rule."
msgstr "Cuir riail bharr leis."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
