msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography for non-heading text."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Tipagrafacht an choirp do théacs nach bhfuil ina cheannlíne."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: hero"
msgstr ""

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Rann ceannlínte lán-leithead le teideal, fo-theideal, agus íomhá chúlra roghnach."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Hero when:"
msgstr "✅ Úsáid Hero nuair atá:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a prominent page header with visual hierarchy\n- The page benefits from a large, eye-catching opening section\n- You want to include background imagery or gradient accents\n🚫 Don't use Hero when:"
msgstr "- Tá ceannlíne leathan, suntasach don leathanach ag teastáil le haistriúchán amhairc\n- Baintear sochar don leathanach as rann tosaigh mór, tarraingteach\n- Más mian leat íomhánna cúlra nó béimeanna grádáin a áireamh\n🚫 Ná húsáid Hero nuair:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a simple page header — use Page-Layout instead\n- The hero competes with critical content — prioritize readability"
msgstr "- Ag tógáil ceannlínne simplí don leathanach — bain úsáid as Page-Layout ina ionad\n- Má iomaíonn an hero leis an ábhar ríthábhachtach — tabhair tosaíocht do inléiteacht"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure the title is in an `<h1>` tag for semantic structure\n- If using background images, provide sufficient color contrast for text\n- Avoid autoplay on video or animation that could distract from content"
msgstr "- Déan cinnte go bhfuil an teideal i lipéad `<h1>` don struchtúr shéamanta\n- Má tá íomhánna cúlra á n-úsáid, soláthair codarsnacht datha leordhóthanach don téacs\n- Seachain imirt uathoibríoch ar fhíseán nó ar ghluaisne a d’fhéadfadh aird a chur ó ábhar"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero subtitle content"
msgstr "Ábhar fo-theidil an Hero"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero title content"
msgstr "Ábhar teidil an Hero"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional action buttons or links."
msgstr "Cnaipí gnímh nó naisc roghnacha."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional background layer (image or gradient)."
msgstr "Sraith chúlra roghnach (íomhá nó grádán)."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for hero text and actions."
msgstr "Coimeádán don téacs agus don na gníomhartha Hero."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional semi-transparent overlay for text contrast."
msgstr "Ciseal tharbhraithe leath-trédheartha roghnach chun codarsnacht téacs a fheabhsú."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional supporting text or description."
msgstr "Téacs tacaíochta nó cur síos roghnach."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main hero title (typically `<h1>`)."
msgstr "Príomhtheidil an Hero (de ghnáth `<h1>`)."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: icon"
msgstr ""

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-icon` — The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "`.instui-icon` — An córas deilbhín: méidú `.instui-icon` agus an péintéir roinnte `-icon-<name>` a chuireann masc ar ghlyph (i `currentColor`) roimh aon eilimint."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph is decorative, so mark it `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; give it a `role` or label only when the icon conveys meaning on its own."
msgstr "Tá an glyph maisiúcháin, mar sin marcáil é `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; tabhair `role` dó nó lipéad air ach amháin nuair a chuireann an deilbhín brí in iúl ina haonar."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set the glyph token (`--pantoken-glyph`) and render it via the shared painter (for example `-icon-search`)."
msgstr "Socraigh an token glyph (`--pantoken-glyph`) agus léiríodh é trína dháileadh tríd an péintéir roinnte (mar shampla `-icon-search`)."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph itself: a 1em box masked from `--pantoken-glyph` and filled with `currentColor`."
msgstr "An glyph féin: bosca 1em a bhfuil masc curtha air ó `--pantoken-glyph` agus líonadh le `currentColor`."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: img"
msgstr ""

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-img` — A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "`.instui-img` — `<img>` stíleáilte le modhnóirí taispeána, gearrtha agus éifeachta a shraith."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Effects compose through the shared `--pantoken-img-filter` custom property, so `-with-grayscale` and `-with-blur` can apply together; the `-constrain-*` crop modifiers require the consumer to size the box explicitly."
msgstr "Comhcheanglaítear éifeachtaí tríd an airí saincheaptha roinnte `--pantoken-img-filter`, mar sin is féidir le `-with-grayscale` agus `-with-blur` a bheith i bhfeidhm le chéile; éilíonn na modhnóirí gearrtha `-constrain-*` go n-méidníonn an tomhaltóir an bosca go sainráite."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Provide meaningful `alt` text that describes the image, and use an empty `alt=\"\"` for purely decorative images so assistive tech skips them."
msgstr "Soláthair téacs `alt` bríomhar a dhéanann cur síos ar an íomhá, agus bain úsáid as `alt=\"\"` folamh d’íomhánna go hiomlán maisiúla ionas go seachnóidh teicneolaíochtaí cúnta iad."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fit within the box (contain)."
msgstr "Scála chun oiriúnú laistigh den bhosca (contain)."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fill the box (cover)."
msgstr "Scála chun an bosca a líonadh (cover)."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display as a block element."
msgstr "Taispeáin mar eilimint bloc."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a blur effect."
msgstr "Cuir éifeacht doiléire i bhfeidhm."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a grayscale effect."
msgstr "Cuir éifeacht liathscála i bhfeidhm."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — The composed CSS filter on the image; the effect modifiers set it, and you can override it for a custom filter."
msgstr "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — An scagaire CSS comhchomhdhéanta ar an íomhá; socraíonn na modhnóirí éifeachta é, agus is féidir é a shárú chun scagaire saincheaptha a úsáid."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: in-place-edit"
msgstr ""

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-in-place-edit` — A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "`.instui-in-place-edit` — [contenteditable] a léitear mar théacs go dtí go bhfaigheann sé fócas, ansin taispeánann sé comhéadan ionchuir."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The input chrome only appears while focused; `-readonly` suppresses both the hover and focus affordances so the element always reads as plain inline text."
msgstr "Ní bhíonn an comhéadan ionchuir le feiceáil ach nuair a bhíonn fócas air; cuireann `-readonly` bac ar an dá áis hover agus fócas ionas go léitear an eilimint i gcónaí mar théacs ionchlannach shimplí."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the editable element `role=\"textbox\"` and an accessible name (`aria-label`)."
msgstr "Tabhair don eilimint inathraithe `role=\"textbox\"` agus ainm inrochtana (`aria-label`)."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shown inline but not editable (no hover/focus affordance)."
msgstr "Taispeánadh mar ionchlannach ach ní féidir é a chur in eagar (níl áis hover/fócas ann)."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — On focus it shows the same input chrome as a text input."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Nuair a bhíonn fócas air, taispeánann sé an comhéadan ionchuir céanna mar ionchur téacs."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS API reference"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS API reference covers pantoken's class-based component layer: components, utilities, global rules, and declarations built on the token system."
msgstr "Clár tagartha API CSS a chlúdaíonn an chiseal comhpháirteanna bunaithe ar rang de pantoken: comhpháirteanna, uirlisí, rialacha domhanda agus ráitis bunaithe ar an gcóras token."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Components"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Ainm"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Class"
msgstr "Rang"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Achoimre"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container for AI agents."
msgstr "Coimeádán dromchla do ghníomhairí AI."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline message with a status colour bar and a masked status glyph from the shared icon set."
msgstr "Teachtaireacht líneach le barra datha stádais agus siombail stádais mhaiscithe ón tsraith íocón roinnte."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A user avatar showing initials or an image, circular by default."
msgstr "Avatáar úsáideora a thaispeánann ainghreamacha nó íomhá, ciorclach de ghnáth."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small count or status dot placed over a target's corner."
msgstr "Pointe beag comhaireamh nó dot stádais suite os cionn chúinne an sprioc."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dismissible, iconed message surface for page-level or in-context announcements."
msgstr "Dromchla teachtaireachta is féidir a diúltú, le híocón, le haghaidh fógraí leibhéal-leathanach nó i gcomhthéacs."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large empty-state or call-to-action block: a hero icon or image, a heading, and a message."
msgstr "Bloc staid folamh mór nó glao-go-gníomh: íocón/laoch nó íomhá, teideal, agus teachtaireacht."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A breadcrumb trail with separators; the last crumb is the current page."
msgstr "Rian 'breadcrumbs' le scaradóirí; is é an slisne dheireanach an leathanach reatha."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), an `<li>` in the parent's `<ol>`; the last one is the current page."
msgstr "Slisne (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), `<li>` i `<ol>` an tuismitheora; is é an ceann deireanach an leathanach reatha."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "Smacht gníomh inrochtaine, stíleáilte ón phailéad token; príomh-mhodhnú de ghnáth."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "Réad meán: figiúr laoch in aice le teideal agus cur síos."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A static month grid with navigation, weekday headers, and day cells."
msgstr "Gréasán míosa statach le nascleanúint, ceanntásca laethanta seachtaine, agus cilléanna lae."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A day cell (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected`, and `-outside-month` mark its state."
msgstr "Cill lae (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); marcálann `-today`, `-selected` agus `-outside-month` a stádas."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."
msgstr "Coimeádán dromchla a ghlacann ábhar ar bith."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native checkbox and its label, or a switch via `-variant-toggle`."
msgstr "Bosca seiceála dúchais agus a lipéad, nó lasc trí `-variant-toggle`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A transparent icon button that draws its own × glyph, in three sizes plus an on-color variant."
msgstr "Cnaipe íocón trédhearcach a tharraingíonn a ghiolgl × féin, i dtrí mhéid agus le leagan dath 'on'."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated callout with a caret, positionable on any side; works as a native `[popover]`."
msgstr "Glao ardaithe le cúinne, inúsáidte ar aon taobh; oibríonn sé mar `[popover]` dúchais."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "Leagan scoilte le tráid taobh atá inchoigeartaithe agus panáil ábhar príomha scrolálaí."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "An phana ábhar príomha a líonann an spás atá fágtha in aice leis an tráid."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "An painéal taobh in aice leis an ábhar príomha, le clúdach roghnach agus modhnóirí dromchla cosúil le tráid."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "Zón titim comhaid le staidí sleamhnaithe (hover), glacta agus diúltaithe."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "Pacálaí réimse foirm: lipéad, a rialuithe, agus leaganacha líneacha, riachtanach, nó achléamh."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "Grúpa `<fieldset>` le finscéal, leagan colún nó líneach, agus spásáil inchoigeartaithe."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "Cabhair réimse agus teachtaireachtaí fíoraithe — leid, earráid, rath, agus do léitheoir scáileáin amháin — le siombail ar earráid agus ar rath."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "Tíopagrafaíocht ceanntásc ó `-level-h1` go `-level-h6`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "`<img>` stíleáilte le modhnóirí taispeána, gearrtha agus éifeachtaí a shraitheann."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "[contenteditable] a léitear mar théacs go dtí go ndéantar fócas air, ansin taispeánann sé chróim ionchuir."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "Aghaidh timpeall ionchur téacs le sliotáin siombailí tosaigh agus iarmhóra."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "Hipearnasc stíleáilte le méideanna, leagan inbhéartaithe do chúlraí dorcha, agus foirmeacha líneacha nó neamhshtíleáilte."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "Liosta le spásáil míreanna tiomáinte ag token."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "Mír liosta (InstUI `List.Item`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "Fabraic chugat san sreabhadh a líonann a thuismitheoir suímh agus a lárnaíonn a ábhar — m.sh. spinner os cionn cárta. Do modal, is fearr `<dialog>` dúchais (is é a `::backdrop` an masc). Tá gach ceann de na modhnóirí seo ar fáil go domhanda freisin (gan aon chiseal, nó slabhraithe ar aon chomhpháirt eile) — féach an ghné dhomhanda `mask`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "Dromchla anuas de mhíreanna, grúpaí agus scaradóirí."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "Ceanncheann grúpa lipéadaithe (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "Iontráil roghchláir (InstUI `Menu.Item`); cuir -disabled, -highlighted, nó -active/[aria-checked]."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "Riail scoilte idir míreanna (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "Staitistic lipéadaithe — luach mór os cionn fotheideal."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "Dromchla comhrá (oibríonn sé ar <dialog> dúchais); codanna ceannlíne, comhlacht agus coisc."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "Réigiún ábhar (InstUI `Modal.Body`); téann `<img>` aonair lán-bleim."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "Réad gníomhartha (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "Réad teidil (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "Aghaidh ionchur-uimhir le colún spinner +/-."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "Nascleanúint leathanach: leathanaigh uimhriúla, an chéad, roimhe, eile agus deireanach saigheada, agus ellipsis do bhearnaí."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A page link or button (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); the current page carries `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "Nasc nó cnaipe leathanach (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); iomparann an leathanach reatha `[aria-current]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "Lipéad stádais dlúth; cuir siombal tosaigh leis an fhoirm roinnte `-icon-<name>`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated surface for a native `[popover]`, positioned with CSS anchor positioning."
msgstr "Dromchla ardaithe do `[popover]` dúchais, a phostáil le suíomhanchur ancaire CSS."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "Baar dul chun cinn sainiúil le méadar datha, méideanna, agus lipéad luach roghnach."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A circular progress ring driven by `--value` and `--value-max` custom properties."
msgstr "Fáinne dul chun cinn ciorclach tiomáinte ag airíonna saincheaptha `--value` agus `--value-max`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "Cnaipe raidió dúchais agus a lipéad."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "`<fieldset>` raidió roghnú-aonair, simplí nó mar lasc roinnte nasctha."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "Sleamhnán raon stíleáilte le bublán luach inbhéartaithe."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "Rátáil réalta le gliafa lán agus folamh agus lipéad uimhriúil roghnach."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "Ráill nascleanúna ingearach le míreanna lógó-os-cairtéil, le mód íosta a thaispeánann ach íocóin."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "Iontráil nascleanúna (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); léiríonn `-selected` an ceann atá gníomhach."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "`<select>` dúchasach stíleáilte le cúrsóir, ag comhoiriúnú le stáidí agus méideanna ionchur téacs."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "Fáinne luchtaithe beochana; tabhair dó role=\"status\" agus aria-label."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "Tábla sonraí stíleáilte do `th` agus `td` plus caption roghnach, le leaganacha hover, seasta, agus cárta-staca."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "Grúpa sraitheanna sonraí an tábla (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "Ceall sonraí (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "Ceall ceannleathan colún (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); an stíl réamhshocraithe `th`, á shárú ag `table.row-header` do `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "Grúpa sraithe ceanntásc an tábla (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "Sraith tábla (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "Ceall ceann-sraithe (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); stíleáilte ó na tóicní ceann-sraithe, ní ó na cinn ceann-colún."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "Sraith painéil lipéadaithe: liosta tab, tabs roghnaithe, agus a bpaintéil."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "An painéal ábhair do taba (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "Cnaipe taba singil (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, cumraítear trí liosta taba an tuismitheora `Tabs`); léiríonn `-selected` an ceann atá gníomhach."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "Cipe inlíne do eochairfhocal nó scagaire."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "Cló corpéige le modhnóirí méid, meáchan, dath agus stíl."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "`<textarea>` dúchasach stíleáilte, inathraithe le méideanna agus stáidí mar an ionchur téacs."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "`<input>` dúchasach stíleáilte — lena n-áirítear `date`, `time`, agus `datetime-local`, áit a soláthraíonn an brabhsálaí an roghnóir — le stáidí bailíochtaithe agus méideanna."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "Fholáireamh `<details>` dúchasach stíleáilte le chevron rothlaithe."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "Fholáireamh le teorainn tógtha ar `<details>`: sraith achoimre le chevron agus ábhar collapsible."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "Púipín tooltip CSS le hover agus fócas, in ann a shuíomh ar aon taobh."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "Painéal faoi ghlas ar imeall a sleamhníonn isteach ó aon taobh; `[popover]` dúchasach nó `<dialog>`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "Crann foláirimh de bhailiúcháin nasted agus míreanna duille, le chevrons rothlaithe."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The View primitive: a neutral box with key-value modifiers for background, border, radius, shadow, display, position, overflow, and cursor. Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."
msgstr "An primití View: bosca neodrach le modhnóirí eochair‑luach don chúlra, teorainn, radius, scáth, taispeáint, suíomh, sreamsa, agus curser. Tá gach ceann de na modhnóirí seo ar fáil go domhanda freisin (gan aon rud, nó curtha i gcateangan ar aon chomhpháirt) — féach na fóntais `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Utilities"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr "Fóntais dathanna seamantaíochta: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (ata ailtithe mar `.--color-<name>`), agus `.--border-<name>` don phailéad seiméantach roghnaithe. Tá ailtóir modhnóra ceangailte le gach ceann acu freisin (m.sh. `-bg-danger` ar aon `.instui-<component>`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`cursor` as a composable, global class — `.--cursor-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."
msgstr "`cursor` mar ranga comhdhlúthchomhlach — `.--cursor-<value>` — inúsáidte glan nó curtha i gcateangan ar aon chomhpháirt (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "Fóntais flex/grid `gap` ar scála spáis, lithe ( `--gap-sm` ) nó fada ( `--gap-small` ) eagrán. Inúsáidte glan nó curtha i gcateangan ar aon chomhpháirt (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — d’fhéadfadh go sárófaí comhpháirteanna a shocraíonn a `gap` féin ó thóicní sonrach comhpháirte."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "An córas íocón: méid `.instui-icon` plus an péintéir comhroinnte `-icon-<name>` a mhaisiúann gliaph (in `currentColor`) roimh aon eilimint."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "Fóntais taispeána agus ailínithe téacs — `.--display-<value>` agus `.--text-align-<value>` — mar ranganna domhanda comhdhlúthchomhlacha, inúsáidte glan nó curtha i gcateangan ar aon chomhpháirt."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "Cóip dhomhanda dhúbailte de mhodhnóirí clúdach comhpháirte `mask` — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — inúsáidte glan nó curtha i gcateangan ar aon chomhpháirt, gan é a chaitheamh i gcomhpháirt `.instui-mask`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` mar ranganna domhanda comhdhlúthchomhlacha — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — inúsáidte glan nó curtha i gcateangan ar aon chomhpháirt."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`position` as a composable, global class — `.--position-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."
msgstr "`position` mar ranga domhanda comhdhlúthchomhlacha — `.--position-<value>` — inúsáidte glan nó curtha i gcateangan ar aon chomhpháirt (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "Ranganna taispeána/folaigh leathanach-ríomh nó leathanach-choimeádáin trasna scála briseadh téamaithe."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "Folaíonn amhairc ábhar faoi choinne rochtain do theicneolaíocht chabhrach (an patrún clip caighdeánach)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "Úsáideacha do mhargh agus padding — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` agus `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` ar an scála spásála (taobhanna `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` nó gan, scríofa giorra nó go hiomlán — mar shampla tá `--mb-sm` agus `--margin-bottom-small` mar an riail chéanna; glacann margin freisin `auto`). Inúsáidte mar aon nó ceangailte le haon chomhpháirt (mar shampla `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "Úsáidí do dhromchla z-index — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — inúsáidte mar aon nó ceangailte le haon chomhpháirt, ionas go dtuaslagann na sraitheanna go réasúnta seachas le huimhreacha socraithe de láimh."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "Rangaí staid beochana don chomhpháirt `Transition` — `.instui-transition` agus rangaí staid (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, srl.) — inúsáidte mar aon nó ceangailte le haon chomhpháirt."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "Truncáil le ellipsis le clamping línte rialaithe ag `--lines` — inúsáidte mar aon nó ceangailte le haon chomhpháirt (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A layout-debugging outline: compound `.-with-visual-debug` onto any element to outline the box and its immediate children, so a layout's structure is visible at a glance."
msgstr "Cruthú léirithe le haghaidh dífhabhtaithe leagan: cuir `.-with-visual-debug` ar chomhdhúil ar aon eilimint chun bosca agus a pháistí láithreach a chur os comhair, ionas go mbeidh struchtúr an leagan le feiceáil go tapa."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Rules"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opt-in global reset: `box-sizing`, the page surface, base text colour and font, `color-scheme`, and link defaults."
msgstr "Athshocrú domhanda roghnach: `box-sizing`, dromchla na leathanach, dath bun téacs agus cló, `color-scheme`, agus réamhshocruithe na nascanna."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "Réamhshocruithe typagrafacha do HTML amh — ceantair, míreanna, liostaí, nascanna, agus cód — curtha i bhfeidhm go huathoibríoch áit ar importáladh é (réamhshocrú `:where(body)`); pas `options.scope` chun sprioc a leagan ar fhreastalaí ábhar eile (m.sh. `.vp-doc`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Plugins"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure product logos as CSS image tokens: `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` holds a data-URI SVG, so a logo paints via e.g. `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."
msgstr "Lóga táirgí Instructure mar thóna íomhá CSS: coinníonn `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` SVG i bhformáid data-URI, mar sin péinteáiltear lógó trí m.sh. `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Opt-in utility classes for the raw primitive palette: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` paint a colour from the primitive colour tokens, plus `font-family`/`font-weight` utilities for the primitive font tokens. Kept out of the semantic utilities so overrides there stay semantic-only."
msgstr "Ranganna uilíoch roghnacha don phailéad primitiúil amh: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` péinteáiltear dath ó na tóicní dath primitiúla, chomh maith le `font-family`/`font-weight` do na tóicní cló primitiúla. Coimeádtha amach ó na huirlisí searmanais ionas go bhfanann áiríodhcháin ann amháin."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline information alert for a short reminder or note."
msgstr "Foláireamh faisnéise líneach le haghaidh meabhrán nó nótaí ghearra."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "Rann ceanntásc le leithead iomlán le teideal, fo-theideal, agus íomhá cúlra roghnach."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "Leagan leathanach caighdeánach trí-cholún le ceannlíne, barra taobh, agus príomh-ábhar."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "Nóta struchtúrtha le catagóirí rubairisce agus táscairí scórála."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "Taispeántas luachana nó téestimónta le haitheantas agus íomhá roghnach."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "Leagan dhá-cholún le réigiúin ábhar clé agus deas."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "Sraith app-shell: nascleanúint taobh, coimeádán le ceannlíne, agus painéal roghnach."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-input-group` — A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "`.instui-input-group` — Clúdach timpeall ionchur téacs le sliotáin deilbhín tosaigh agus iarmhí."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps the same field chrome as `text-input` with icon slots either side of it; `-should-not-wrap` is only needed when the group's contents would otherwise overflow onto a second line."
msgstr "Clúdaíonn sé an chrome réimse céanna mar `text-input` le sliotáin deilbhín ar gach taobh; ní bhíonn `-should-not-wrap` riachtanach ach nuair a bheadh ábhar an ghrúpa ag sreabhadh go dtí an dara líne."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/input-group/input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/input-group/input-group.css)"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Disabled state."
msgstr "Stádas díchumasaithe."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the group on one line (no wrapping)."
msgstr "Coinnigh an grúpa ar líne amháin (gan fillte)."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success (valid) state."
msgstr "Stád rathúil (bailí)."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The trailing content slot."
msgstr "An sliotán ábhair iarmhí."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The leading content slot."
msgstr "An sliotán ábhair tosaigh."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The placeholder text of the inner input, in a muted color."
msgstr "An téacs ionaid den ionchur istigh, i ndath éadrom."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Wraps a text input, adding leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Clúdaíonn ionchur téacs, ag cur sliotáin deilbhín tosaigh agus iarmhí leis."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--display-flex` — Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.--display-flex` — uirlisí taispeána agus ailínithe téacs — `.--display-<value>` agus `.--text-align-<value>` — mar chláir chomhdháilte, dhomhanda, inúsáidte go díreach nó nasctha le haon chomhpháirt."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets `display: flex`."
msgstr "Socraíonn `display: flex`."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display utilities: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex`, and `none`."
msgstr "Uirlisí taispeána: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex`, agus `none`."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text-alignment utilities: `start`, `center`, `end`, and `justify`."
msgstr "Uirlisí ailínithe téacs: `start`, `center`, `end`, agus `justify`."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: link"
msgstr ""

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-link` — A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "`.instui-link` — Nasc stíleáilte le méideanna, le éagsúlacht inbhéartaithe do chúlraí dorcha, agus foirmeacha inlíne nó gan stíl."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own responsive `gap` between an icon and its text (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé a `gap` freagartha idir íocón agus a théacs (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` é a scála); má cheanglaítear modhnóir áisiúlachta spáis `-gap-*` cuirtear an luach ionsuite sin as a bhfeidhm."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a disabled link with `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Comharthaigh nasc dífheidhmithe le `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For dark backgrounds."
msgstr "Do chúlraí dorcha."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline link, underlined within flowing text."
msgstr "Nasc inlíne, faoi-líneáilte i measc téacs sreafa."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "Nasc inlíne mór (úsáidtear le `-inline`)."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "Nasc inlíne beag (úsáidtear le `-inline`)."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Strip link styling: inherit colour, no underline."
msgstr "Bain stíl an nasc: glac an dath óna chomhthéacs, gan faoi-líne."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — A breadcrumb trail is built from links; also its small-screen fallback (pair with the `responsive` utility to swap Breadcrumb for a Link below ~768px)."
msgstr "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — Tógann slabhra breadcrumb ó na naisc; chomh maith lena fhill ar scáileáin bheaga (péireáil leis an `responsive` uirlis chun Breadcrumb a mhalartú le Link faoi bhun ~768px)."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — Mír liosta (InstUI `List.Item`)."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `list`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, and `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` modifiers restyle this member — see `list`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Cuireann modhnóirí `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, agus `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` ar `list` tuismitheora stíl nua don chomhalta seo — féach doiciméad `list` chun na modhnóirí sin a fheiceáil."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a dashed rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "Scar míreanna le líne bhriste. @affects list.item — Cuirtear an riail scarála idir míreanna."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a solid rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "Scar míreanna le líne leanúnach. @affects list.item — Cuirtear an riail teorann idir míreanna."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ordered-list numbering. @affects list.item — Adds marker weight and indentation."
msgstr "Uimhirniú liosta ordaithe. @affects list.item — Cuirtear meáchan an marcóra agus spásáil leis."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the list bullet or ordered-list number."
msgstr "Léiríonn sé bolgán an liosta nó uimhir liosta ordaithe."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — Liosta le spásáil míreanna tiomáinte ag tokens."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `padding-inline-start` for list indentation; chaining a `-p*`/`-padding*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value. See the `list.item` member for the individual items."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé a `padding-inline-start` féin do dhíthuaiscint liosta; má chuireann tú modhnóir áise spásála `-p*`/`-padding*` i slabhra déanann sé sin faillí ar an luach ionsuite sin. Féach an ball `list.item` do na míreanna aonair."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay items out inline (horizontal)."
msgstr "Leagan amach na míreanna inlíne (cothrománach)."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Mór. @affects list.item — Oireann sé spásáil na míreanna dá chéile. Ailias fhada de `-size-lg`."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "Mór. @affects list.item — Oireann sé spásáil na míreanna dá chéile."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "Meánach (réamhshocraithe). @affects list.item — Oireann sé spásáil na míreanna dá chéile."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "Meánach (réamhshocraithe). @affects list.item — Oireann sé spásáil na míreanna dá chéile. Ailias fhada de `-size-md`."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "Beag. @affects list.item — Oireann sé spásáil na míreanna dá chéile."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Beag. @affects list.item — Oireann sé spásáil na míreanna dá chéile. Ailias fhada de `-size-sm`."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove markers and padding."
msgstr "Bain marcálacha agus spásáil inmheánach."

#: css/logos.md
