#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: page-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Leagan le trí cholún caighdeánach le ceannlíne, barra taobh agus príomh-ábhar."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "✅ Úsáid Page-Layout nuair a:"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a classic page structure with navigation and content areas\n- The page has a clear main content area flanked by complementary regions\n- You want consistent spacing and alignment across the layout\n🚫 Don't use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "- Tá struchtúr clasaiceach le nascleanúint agus réimsí ábhair uait\n- Tá réimse príomh-ábhar soiléir ar an leathanach, le réigiúin chomhlántacha ar gach taobh\n- Ba mhaith leat spásáil agus ailíniú comhsheasmhach ar fud an leagain\n🚫 Ná húsáid Page-Layout nuair a:"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a single-column page — use a simpler layout instead\n- The sidebar competes with main content for importance"
msgstr "- Ag tógáil leathanach le colún amháin — bain úsáid as leagan níos simplí ina ionad\n- Má bhíonn an barra taobh i gcomórtas leis an príomh-ábhar maidir le tábhacht"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a `<main>` landmark\n- Give the sidebar `role=\"navigation\"` or `role=\"complementary\"` as appropriate\n- Ensure landmark regions have distinct aria-labels"
msgstr "- Mapáil an réimse príomh-ábhair chuig tírchomhartha `<main>`\n- Tabhair don bharra taobh `role=\"navigation\"` nó `role=\"complementary\"` de réir mar is cuí\n- Déan cinnte go bhfuil lipéid aria difriúla ag na réigiúin tírchomhartha"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main body containing sidebar and content."
msgstr "Príomhchorp ina bhfuil an barra taobh agus an t-ábhar."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom footer region."
msgstr "Réigiún bun."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top header region."
msgstr "Réigiún ceannlíne uachtarach."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Central content area."
msgstr "Réigiún ábhair lárnach."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Left navigation or auxiliary column."
msgstr "Colún nascleanúna clé nó colún cúnta."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pagination"
msgstr ""

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-pagination` — Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "`.instui-pagination` — Nascleanúint leathanach: leathanaigh uimhrithe, saigheadacha chéad, roimhe, ar aghaidh agus deireanach, agus ellipsís do bearnaí."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `pagination.page` member for the individual page controls."
msgstr "Féach an ball `pagination.page` don rialú aonair ar leathanaigh."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [page.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pagination/members/page/page.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [page.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pagination/members/page/page.css)"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the `<nav>` with aria-label, mark the current page with aria-current=\"page\", give each arrow an aria-label, and disable end arrows with disabled or aria-disabled=\"true\"."
msgstr "Lipéadaigh an `<nav>` le aria-label, marcáil an leathanach reatha le aria-current=\"page\", tabhair aria-label do gach saighead, agus déan na saigheadacha deiridh neamhghníomhach le disabled nó aria-disabled=\"true\"."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render arrow glyph icons inside the first/prev/next/last controls."
msgstr "Taispeáin siombailí saighead laistigh de na rialuithe chéad/roimhe/ar aghaidh/deireanach."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compact variant with a page-number input."
msgstr "Leagan dlúth le réimse iontrála uimhre leathanach."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A first, previous, next, or last control."
msgstr "Rialú chéad, roimhe, ar aghaidh, nó deireanach."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The gap marker between page ranges."
msgstr "An marcóir bearna idir raonta leathanach."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The label for the page-number input (input variant)."
msgstr "An lipéad don réimse iontrála uimhre leathanach (eagrán iontrála)."

#: css/pagination.page.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pagination.page"
msgstr ""

#: css/pagination.page.md
#, no-c-format
