#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-pill` — A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "`.instui-pill` — Lipéad stádais dlúth; cuir glyf tosaigh leis an fhoirm chomhroinnte `-icon-<name>`."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Unlike `badge`, which shows a count, or `tag`, which is removable, the pill is a static status label; its leading glyph is a masked `::before`, not an `<img>`."
msgstr "Murab ionann agus `badge`, a thaispeánann comhaireamh, nó `tag`, a bhíonn inbhainte, is lipéad stádais shochraithe é an pill; is `::before` maiscithe é an glyf tosaigh, ní `<img>`."

