msgid "Informational meter colour."
msgstr "Dath meter eolais."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (primary inverse) meter colour."
msgstr "Dath meter ar dhorcha (inmhalartaithe bunúsach)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success meter colour."
msgstr "Dath meter rathúnais."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning meter colour."
msgstr "Dath meter rabhaidh."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-color-brand`."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-should-animate`."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate the meter, ring, and centered value into place on mount."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default)."
msgstr "Meán (réamhshocraithe)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "Meán (réamhshocraithe). Ailias fhada ar `-size-md`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text centred in the ring's hole."
msgstr "An téacs luach lárnaithe i bpócaire an fháinne."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; spins `::before` at a fixed arc and hides `.value`."
msgstr "Saincheaptha, ní cuid d'InstUI é. I bhfeidhm amháin ar `<progress>` dúchais nach bhfuil a thréith `value` ann; casann sé `::before` ag arc seasta agus cuireann sé i bhfolach `.value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the ring itself: a conic-gradient donut clipped with a radial mask, whose arc tracks the `--value` custom property."
msgstr "Tarpaingíonn sé an fáinne féin: donut conic-gradient scartha le masc radial, a rianaíonn arc an `--value` airíonna saincheaptha."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds to wait before starting the mount animation (default `0`)."
msgstr "Milsceanaillí le fanacht sula dtosaíonn an beochan mount (réamhshocraithe `0`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "An luach uasta dul chun cinn (réamhshocraithe `100`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The minimum meter value (default `0`)."
msgstr "An luach íosta don meter (réamhshocraithe `0`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled arc (meter) colour; the -color-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Dath an arc lánaithe (meter); leagann na modhnóirí -color-* é."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ring's stroke width; the -size-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Leithead stróc an fháinne; leagann na modhnóirí -size-* é."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The unfilled track colour."
msgstr "Dath an rian nach bhfuil lánaithe."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value; registered with @property so it can transition."
msgstr "An luach reatha dul chun cinn; cláraithe le @property ionas go bhféadfadh sé trasnú."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias {@link --max} The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "@alias {@link --max} An luach uasta dul chun cinn (réamhshocraithe `100`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias Alias for `--value`."
msgstr "@alias Ailias do `--value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Registers the numeric progress properties with `@property` and paints with CSS `mask` and `conic-gradient`; where custom-property transitions are unsupported the ring still renders but won't animate."
msgstr "- Cláraíonn sé na hairíonna uimhriúla dul chun cinn le `@property` agus péinteálann sé le CSS `mask` agus `conic-gradient`; i gcás nach dtacaítear le trasnuithe airíonna saincheaptha, fós léirítear an fáinne ach ní bheidh beochan ann."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — The linear bar form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — An fhoirm barra líneach den dul chun cinn deimhnithe céanna."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: progress"
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr ".instui-progress · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">seasmhach</span> — Barra dul chun cinn shonrach le méadar daite, méideanna, agus lipéad luacha roghnach."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.value` is a sibling of `.bar`, both children of the root — mirroring how progress-circle nests its own `.value` part. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), animating `.bar` as a sliding segment and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
msgstr "'.value' mar chomhghleacaí le '.bar', araon ina bpáistí den root — ag léiriú conas a chuireann progress-circle a chuid féin '.value' istigh. Níl staid neamhchinnte ag InstUI; is buille faoi thuairim amháin do pantoken é :indeterminate (an dúchais `<progress>` gan tréith value), ag beochan `.bar` mar mhír sleamhnáin agus ag cur i bhfolach `.value` toisc nach bhfuil aon uimhir bhríomhar le taispeáint. Níl staid neamhchinnte ag `<meter>`, mar sin ní bhíonn tionchar air."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders `.value` inside the track, aligned to its start, instead of beside it; style it for legibility over the meter colour."
msgstr "Cuireann sé `.value` laistigh den rian, ailínithe lena thús, in ionad é a chur taobh leis; stíligh é ionas go mbeidh sé léite go soiléir thar dhath an mhéadair."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate meter changes over half a second."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled meter bar."
msgstr "An barra mhéadair líonta."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text beside the bar."
msgstr "Téacs an luach in aice leis an mbarra."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; animates `.bar` as a sliding segment and hides `.value`."
msgstr "Saincheaptha, ní chuid de InstUI é. Tá sé i bhfeidhm ach ar a native `<progress>` nach bhfuil an tréith `value` aige; cuireann sé beochan ar `.bar` mar ghné sleamhnach agus cuireann sé `.value` i bhfolach."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the track's bottom rule as its own layer over the meter, so the full border and the bottom border stay independent across themes."
msgstr "Tarraingíonn sé rialach bhun an rian mar shraith féin os cionn an mhéadair, ionas go bhfanann an teorainn iomlán agus an teorainn bhun neamhspleách thar théamaí."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value."
msgstr "An luach reatha ar an dul chun cinn."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Scopes the meter part rules with the `@scope` at-rule; browsers without `@scope` support ignore those scoped rules."
msgstr "Scópaíonn sé rialacha 'meter part' leis an at-reglóg `@scope`; déanann brabhsálaithe nach dtacaíonn le `@scope` neamhaird ar na rialacha scóipithe sin."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — The circular form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — Foirm chiorclach den dul chun cinn sonraithe céanna."

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: prose"
msgstr "# CSS: prose"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`:where(body)` — Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "`:where(body)` — Réamhshocruithe clóforbartha do HTML amh — teidil, paragraif, liostaí, naisc, agus cód — curtha i bhfeidhm go huathoibríoch áit ar iompórtálfar é (réamhshocrú `:where(body)`); pasáil `options.scope` chun fréamh-ábhar ábhar eile a shocrú ina ionad (m.sh. `.vp-doc`)."

