#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio-input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio-input-group` — A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "`.instui-radio-input-group` — cnaipe roghnú aonair `<fieldset>`, simplí nó mar lasc rannógach nasctha."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between radios; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé a `gap` féin idir raidióanna; má shreangtar modhnóir áise spáis `-gap-*`, cuireann sé sin an luach ionsuite sin in ionad."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>` that names the group; the child radios share one `name`, so only one can be selected at a time."
msgstr "Taispeánann sé `<fieldset>` dúchais le `<legend>` a thugann ainm don ghrúpa; roinntear `name` amháin ag na raidióanna páistí, mar sin ní féidir ach ceann a roghnú ag an am."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Toggle variant"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out in columns."
msgstr "Socraigh na raidióanna i gcolúin."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out inline."
msgstr "Socraigh na raidióanna ar líne."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the child toggles out as a segmented control (only the selected segment fills)."
msgstr "Socraigh na lascanna páistí mar rialtán rannógach (ní líonann ach an rannóg roghnaithe)."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — The individual control this group collects.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — The general wrapper for grouping and laying out fields."
msgstr "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — An rialtán aonair a bhailíonn an ghrúpa seo.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — An clúdach ghinearálta don ghrúpáil agus don shocrú réimsí."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio` — A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "`.instui-radio` — cnaipe raidió dúchais agus a lipéad."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé a `gap` féin idir an rialtóir agus a lipéad; má cheanglaítear modhnóir úsáideacha spáis `-gap-*` cuireann sé an luach ionsuite sin as feidhm."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native `<input type=\"radio\">` drives `:checked` and `:disabled`; `-readonly` is styling only, since radios have no native readonly attribute."
msgstr "Tiománann `<input type=\"radio\">` dúchais `:checked` agus `:disabled`; is é `-readonly` a bhaineann le stíliú amháin, ós níl airíonna 'readonly' dúchasacha ag raidióanna."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Danger context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Dath comhthéacs contúirte (athróg lasc)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Off/neutral context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Dath comhthéacs as/neodrach (athróg lasc)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Dath comhthéacs rathúlachta (athróg lasc)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Dath comhthéacs rabhaidh (athróg lasc)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-variant-toggle`."
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render as a segmented toggle button."
msgstr "Rindreáil mar chnaipe lasc roinnithe."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled inner dot shown when checked; on `-variant-toggle` it is the focus ring drawn just outside the pill."
msgstr "An phonc istigh líonta a thaispeántar nuair a sheiceáladh é; ar `-variant-toggle` is é an fáinne fócas a tharraingítear díreach lasmuigh den phioll."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle's selected fill colour; the -context-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Dath líontha roghnaithe an lasc; socraítear é leis na modhnóirí -context-*."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — The multi-select counterpart to a single-select radio.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Collects radios into one single-select fieldset."
msgstr "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — An comhpháirt ilroghnaithe i gcomparáid le raidió aonroghnaithe.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Bailíonn raidióanna le chéile i gfieldset aonroghnaithe amháin."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: range-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-range-input` — A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "`.instui-range-input` — Sleamhnán raon stíleáilte le buabha luacha inbhéartaithe."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each vendor thumb/track pseudo-element needs its own separate rule — grouping them in one selector list would invalidate the whole rule in browsers that don't recognize the other vendor's pseudo."
msgstr "Gach pseudo-eilimint thumb/track ar sonraíóir caithfidh a riail féin a bheith aici — chuir a ghrúpáil i liosta roghnóra amháin díobh díchumasóidh an riail iomlán i mbrabhsálaithe nach n-aithníonn pseudo an soláthraí eile."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control is a native `<input type=\"range\">`; give it an accessible name with `aria-label` or an associated `<label>`."
msgstr "Is `<input type=\"range\">` dúchais é an rialtóir; tabhair ainm inrochtana dó le `aria-label` nó le `<label>` a bhaineann leis."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the value bubble's caret, a small triangle pointing back toward the track."
msgstr "Tarraingíonn sé an \"caret\" den bhuabha luacha — triantán beag ag pointeáil ar ais chuig an rian."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The typed numeric-entry counterpart."
msgstr "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — An chomhpháirt iontrála uimhriúil téacsaithe."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rating"
msgstr ""

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-rating` — A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "`.instui-rating` — Rátáil réalta le glifí líonta agus folmha agus lipéad uimhriúil roghnach."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between star glyphs; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé a `gap` féin idir glifí réalta; má cheanglaítear modhnóir fóntais spásála `-gap-*`, cuireann sé thar an luach ionsuite sin."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give it role=\"img\" and an aria-label stating the rating, since the stars are icon glyphs."
msgstr "Tabhair dó role=\"img\" agus aria-label a luaíonn an rátáil, toisc gur glifí íocón iad na réaltaí."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render star glyphs with icon classes (for example, `-icon-star-solid`)."
msgstr "Taispeáin na glifí réalta le ranganna íocón (mar shampla, `-icon-star-solid`)."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The numeric label, e.g. \"3/5\"."
msgstr "An lipéad uimhriúil, m.sh. \"3/5\"."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: responsive"
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Ranganna taispeána/fola bunaithe ar leithead an fhuinneog amhairc nó an choimeádáin thar scála sosbriste téamaithe."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` hide by viewport width; `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` are the inverse (hidden by default, shown only inside the range via `display: revert`); the `-cq-` variants react to a `.instui-container` ancestor's width instead, not the viewport's. Scale tiers `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (sourced from the IR's tray-width component tokens) are each aliased to a long-form spelling (`x-small`–`x-large`) and a device name (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — both deprecated in favor of the short name — plus the unscaled, themed `content`/`content-full-width` tiers (the main content area's max-width)."
msgstr "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` a fhola de réir leithead an fhuinneog amhairc; is iad `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` an mhalairt (folaithe de réir réamhshocraithe, le feiceáil amháin laistigh den raon trí `display: revert`); freagraíonn na éagsúlachtaí `-cq-` ar leithead seanmhéanmáistir `.instui-container` in áit leithead an fhuinneog amhairc. Tá sraitheanna scála `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (a fhaightear ó thóicíní comhpháirte tray-width san IR) aliasáilte chuig ainm fhada foirmiúil (`x-small`–`x-large`) agus ainm gléas (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — araon as dáta i bhfabhar an ainm ghort — agus na sraitheanna téamaithe neamhscála `content`/`content-full-width` (uasmhéid leithead an phríomh-ábhar)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts)"

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `content` breakpoint (`68.75em`)."
msgstr "Fola nuair atá an coimeádán marcáilte ag an nó faoi bhun an sosbriste `content` (`68.75em`)."

