#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rubric-note"
msgstr ""

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-rubric-note\"]` — Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-rubric-note\"]` — Nóta struchtúrtha le catagóirí rubair agus táscairí scórála."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Rubric-Note when:"
msgstr "✅ Úsáid Rubric-Note nuair a:"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying grading rubric or assessment criteria\n- You need to structure content by category with scores or indicators\n- The layout should emphasize structure and hierarchy\n🚫 Don't use Rubric-Note when:"
msgstr "- Ag taispeáint rubair mharcála nó critéir mheasúnaithe\n- Tá gá agat ábhar a struchtúrú de réir catagóire le scóirí nó táscairí\n- Ba chóir don leagan amach béim a leagan ar struchtúr agus ar hórdon\n🚫 Ná húsáid Rubric-Note nuair a:"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying simple notes or comments — use Callout instead\n- Complex grading logic is needed — consider a custom component"
msgstr "- Ag taispeáint nótaí nó tráchtaireachtaí simplí — bain úsáid as Callout ina áit\n- Tá loighic mharcála chasta de dhíth — smaoinigh ar chomhpháirt shaincheaptha"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use table semantics if displaying a true rubric with rows and columns\n- Ensure score indicators are not color-only\n- Provide descriptive labels for each category"
msgstr "- Úsáid shéanmantacht tábla má tá rubair fhíor á thaispeáint le sraitheanna agus colúin\n- Cinntigh nach bhfuil táscairí scórála bunaithe ar dhath amháin\n- Cuir lipéid thuairisciúla ar fáil do gach catagóir"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for rubric criteria rows."
msgstr "Coimeádán do shraitheanna critéar rubair."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Detailed description of the criterion."
msgstr "Cur síos mionsonraithe ar an chritéar."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Header with title and metadata."
msgstr "Ceanntásc le teideal agus meiteashonraí."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Criterion name or category."
msgstr "Ainm an chritéir nó catagóir."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Individual criterion row."
msgstr "Sraith chritéar aonair."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Score indicator or badge."
msgstr "Táscaire scórála nó deilbhín."

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: screen-reader-content"
msgstr "# CSS: screen-reader-content"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-screen-reader-content` — Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "`.instui-screen-reader-content` — Folaíonn ábhar go radhaircach agus é ar fáil fós do theicneolaíochtaí cúnta (an phatrún clip caighdeánach)."

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [screen-reader-content.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [screen-reader-content.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css)"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keeps text in the accessibility tree for screen readers while removing it from the visual layout."
msgstr "Coinníonn sé téacs sa chrann inrochtaineachta do léitheoirí scáileáin, agus é a bhaint as an leagan amhairc."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: side-nav-bar.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.item` — Iontráil nascleanúna (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); comharthaíonn `-selected` an ceann gníomhach."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `side-nav-bar`'s `-minimized` modifier hides this member's `.label` — see `side-nav-bar`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Cuireann modhnóir `-minimized` den `side-nav-bar` tuismitheora folach ar `.label` an bhaill seo — féach ar dhoiciméad `side-nav-bar` féin maidir leis an modhnóir sin."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active nav item."
msgstr "An mír nascleanúna gníomhach."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The item's text label; hidden when the rail is minimized."
msgstr "Lipéad téacs na míre; folaithe nuair a bhíonn an ráil íoslaghdaithe."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: side-nav-bar"
msgstr ""

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — Rian nascleanúna ingearach d'earraí le híocóin os cionn lipéid, le mód íosta a thaispeánann ach íocónna."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between nav items and its own `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. See the `side-nav-bar.item` member for the individual nav entries."
msgstr "Socraíonn a `gap` féin idir na míreanna nascleanúna agus a `padding` féin; má shlabhraítear modhnóir uirlise eatramh `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` cuirtear in ionad na luachanna ionsuite sin. Féach an ball `side-nav-bar.item` do na iontrálacha nascleanúna aonair."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the `<nav>` with aria-label so it's announced as a named navigation landmark."
msgstr "Lipéadaigh an `<nav>` le aria-label ionas go ndéantar é a fhógairt mar threoir nascleanúna ainmniúil."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a glyph icon in each nav item."
msgstr "Taispeáin íocón glyf i ngach mír nascleanúna."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collapse to icons only (labels hidden). @affects side-nav-bar.item — Hides the item's label."
msgstr "Laghdaigh go dtí íocónna amháin (lipéid i bhfolach). @affects side-nav-bar.item — Folaíonn sé lipéad na míre."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The nav item's text label."
msgstr "Lipéad téacs na míre nascleanúna."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: simple-select"
msgstr ""

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-simple-select` — A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-simple-select` — `<select>` dúchais stíleáilte le cúrsóir, ag freagairt do staidí agus méideanna an ionchuir téacs."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps a plain native `<select>` with no custom dropdown/menu markup, so browser-native option rendering and keyboard behavior apply as-is; it shares its field chrome with `text-input`."
msgstr "Clúdaíonn sé `<select>` dúchais shimplí gan marcáil saincheaptha don liosta anuas/biachlár, ionas go n-úsáidtear léiriú rogha dúchais an bhrabhsálaí agus iompar an mhéarchláir mar atá; roinneann sé a chuma réimse le `text-input`."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [select.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/select/select.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [select.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/select/select.css)"

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The placeholder text, in a muted color that shifts on hover."
msgstr "An téacs réamhsholáthair, i ndath mhaolaithe a athraíonn nuair a chuireann tú an cúrsóir air."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same field chrome, states, and sizes.\n- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — The dropdown surface a richer select reuses."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Roinnann an chuma réimse, na staidí agus na méideanna céanna.\n- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — An dromchla don liosta anuas a athúsáideann select níos saibhre."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: spacing"
msgstr ""

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--p-md` — Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "`.--p-md` — Uirlisí imeall agus padding — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` agus `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` ar an scála eatramhach (taobhanna `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` nó gan aon cheann, litrithe gairid nó lánfhada — mar shampla tá `--mb-sm` agus `--margin-bottom-small` an riail chéanna; glacann imeall freisin `auto`). Inúsáidte mar atá nó nasctha le haon chomhpháirt (mar shampla `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies medium padding on all sides."
msgstr "Cuireann pad meánach i bhfeidhm ar gach taobh."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin utilities across short, legacy-long, and fully long spellings."
msgstr "Uirlisí imeall i ngach litriú: gairid, sean‑fhada agus lánfhada."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Padding utilities across short, legacy-long, and fully long spellings."
msgstr "Uirlisí padding i ngach litriú: gairid, sean‑fhada agus lánfhada."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: spinner"
msgstr ""

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-spinner` — An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "`.instui-spinner` — Fáinne luchtaithe beochantach; tabhair dó role=\"status\" agus aria-label."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-color-inverse` only repaints the animated top border segment, not the whole track, so it still reads correctly on a dark card without needing a separate track color."
msgstr "`-color-inverse` ní athphéinteálann ach an mír imlíne uachtair bheochantach, ní an rian iomlán, mar sin léitear é i gceart fós ar chárta dorcha gan gá do dhath rian ar leith."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [spinner.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/spinner/spinner.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [spinner.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/spinner/spinner.css)"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the spinner role=\"status\" and an aria-label so screen readers announce it as a live loading status."
msgstr "Tabhair don spinnear role=\"status\" agus aria-label ionas go bhfógraíonn léitheoirí scáileáin é mar stádas luchtaithe beo."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Inverse color -nocard"
msgstr ""

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On a dark surface."
msgstr "Ar dromchla dorcha."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra-small. Long-form alias of `-size-xs`."
msgstr "Breise-bheag. Alias fhada de `-size-xs`."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra-small."
msgstr "Breise-bheag."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: stacking"
msgstr ""

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--stack-topmost` — z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "`.--stack-topmost` — uirlisí do dhoimhneacht z-index — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — inúsáidte amhail nó slabhraithe ar aon chomhpháirt, ionas go sraitheann na sraitheanna go tuisceanach in ionad uimhreacha socraithe de láimh."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Above the default flow."
msgstr "Os cionn an sreabhadh réamhshocraithe."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Below the default flow."
msgstr "Faoin bhun an sreabhadh réamhshocraithe."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The lowest stacking depth."
msgstr "An doimhneacht sraitheála is ísle."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The highest stacking depth (overlays, menus)."
msgstr "An doimhneacht sraitheála is airde (clúdach, roghchláir)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.body"
msgstr "# CSS: table.body"

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tbody` — The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "`tbody` — Grúpa sraithe sonraí an tábla (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier restyles this member — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Ath-stíleálann modhnóir `-layout-stacked` an `table` thuismitheora an bhall seo — féach ar dhoiciméadú `table` féin don mhodhnóir sin."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.cell"
msgstr "# CSS: table.cell"

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`td` — A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "`td` — Cill sonraí (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier stacks this member as a block and labels it via `::before` — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Cuireann an mhodhnóir `-layout-stacked` ar an `table` thuismitheora an ball seo mar bhloc agus lipéadaíonn sé é trí `::before` — féach dhoiciméadú `table` féin faoin mhodhnóir sin."

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.col-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.col-header"

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th` — A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "`th` — Ceall cheannlíne colúin (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); an stíliú réamhshocraithe `th`, atá curtha thar ceann ag `table.row-header` do `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.head"
msgstr "# CSS: table.head"

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`thead` — The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "`thead` — Grúpa sraithe ceannlíne an tábla (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier visually hides this member (its column titles surface per-cell instead) — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Cuireann modhnóir `-layout-stacked` den mháthair-`table` an ball seo i bhfolach go radhairc (léirítear teidil a cholúin in aghaidh na cille ina ionad) — féach doiciméad `table` don mhodhnóir sin."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table"
msgstr ""

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-table` — A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-table` — Tábla sonraí stíleáilte do `th` agus `td`, chomh maith le fotheideal roghnach, le leaganacha nuair a bhíonn an cúrsóir os cionn, socraithe, agus cárta-staca."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For `-layout-stacked`, pure CSS can't pull each column header's text into its cell, so give every cell a `data-label` and the stacked card shows it via `::before`. See the `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, and `table.row-header` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Maidir le `-layout-stacked`, ní féidir le CSS ghlan téacs gach ceannaire colúin a tharraingt isteach ina chill, mar sin tabhair `data-label` do gach cill agus léiríonn an cárta staca é trí `::before`. Féach ar na baill `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header` agus `table.row-header` don chuid shonracha."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the table with a `<caption>`, mark column headers `<th scope=\"col\">` and row headers `<th scope=\"row\">`, and in `-layout-stacked` give every cell a `data-label` since the header row is visually hidden."
msgstr "Lipéadaigh an tábla le `<caption>`, marcáil ceannairí colún mar `<th scope=\"col\">` agus ceannairí sraithe mar `<th scope=\"row\">`, agus i `-layout-stacked` tabhair `data-label` do gach cill ós rud é go bhfuil an ró-mheirge ceannaire i bhfolach go físiúil."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlight rows on hover. @affects table.row — Reserves and colours the row's hover border."
msgstr "Béim a chur ar shraitheanna nuair a bhíonn an cúrsóir os cionn. @affects table.row — Socraíonn agus dathanna sé teorann sleamhnithe na sraithe."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed table layout (equal-width columns)."
msgstr "Leagan socraithe tábla (colúin le leithead comhionann)."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stack each row as a card, via a per-cell `data-label`. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Stacks each part as a block and hides/labels the header accordingly."
msgstr "Stacaigh gach sraith mar chárta, tríd `data-label` in aghaidh na cille. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Cuireann sé gach cuid mar bhloic agus cuireann sé an ceannaire i bhfolach / lipéadaíonn sé de réir mar is cuí."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional table caption."
msgstr "Fotheideal tábla roghnach."

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row-header"

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — Ceall cheannlíne sraithe (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); stílítear é ó na tacair cheannlínne sraithe, ní ó na tacair ceannlínne colúin."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row"

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tr` — A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "`tr` — Ró thábla (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-hover` and `-layout-stacked` modifiers restyle this member — see `table`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Athstíleálann modhnóirí `-hover` agus `-layout-stacked` an chomhalta seo ón tuismitheoir `table` — féach ar an ndoiciméad féin de `table` maidir leis na modhnóirí sin."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tabs` — A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "`.instui-tabs` — Sraith painéil le cluaisíní: liosta cluaisíní, cluaisíní roghnaithe, agus a bpainéil."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `tabs.tab` and `tabs.panel` members for the individual tab buttons and their content panels."
msgstr "Féach ar na baill `tabs.tab` agus `tabs.panel` le haghaidh na gcnaipí cluaisíní aonair agus a bpainéil ábhair."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire the tab list with role=\"tablist\", each tab with role=\"tab\" and aria-selected, and each panel with role=\"tabpanel\"."
msgstr "Cuir an liosta cluaisíní le role=\"tablist\", gach cluaisín le role=\"tab\" agus aria-selected, agus gach painéal le role=\"tabpanel\"."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the tab list on one line and let it scroll horizontally instead of wrapping, hiding the scrollbar."
msgstr "Coinnigh an liosta cluaisíní ar líne amháin agus lig dó sleamhnú go trasnánach seachas fillte, ag i bhfolach an bharra sleamhnáin."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rounded \"folder\" tabs with a selected tab that visually connects into the panel below. @affects tabs.tab — Restyles the tab buttons into the rounded \"folder\" look."
msgstr "Cluaisíní \"fillteáin\" chiorclacha le cluaisín roghnaithe a nascann go radhairc leis an bpainéal thíos. @affects tabs.tab — Athstílíonn na cnaipí cluaisíní chun cuma \"fillteáin\" chiorclacha a fháil."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The row of tabs."
msgstr "An ró de chluaisíní."

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.panel"
msgstr "# CSS: tabs.panel"

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.panel` — The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "`.panel` — Painéal ábhair do chluaisín (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.tab"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tab` — A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.tab` — Cnaipe cluaisín aonair (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, cumraithe trí liosta na gcluaisíní ar an tuismitheoir `Tabs`); comharthaíonn `-selected` an ceann gníomhach."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier restyles this member into a rounded \"folder\" tab — see `tabs`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Athdhéantar stíl an bhall seo go cluaisín \"fillteáin\" chruinn leis an módhnóir `-variant-secondary` ar an tuismitheoir `tabs` — féach doiciméad `tabs` don módhnóir sin."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Non-interactive; same styling as `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."
msgstr "Neamh-idirghníomhach; an stíl chéanna le `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active tab; same styling as `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "An cluaisín gníomhach; an stíl chéanna le `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tag"
msgstr ""

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tag` — An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "`.instui-tag` — Slisín inlíne d’eochairfhocal nó scagaire."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé a `padding` cothrománach féin (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` é a scálaíonn); cuireann slabhra modhnóir spásála `-p-*`/`-padding-*` thar an luach ionsuite sin."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph."
msgstr "Léitear é inlíne leis an téacs agus faigheann sé giúlfán díshuiteála ag an deireadh."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read-only (non-dismissable) tag."
msgstr "Lipéad léithe amháin (nach féidir a dhíchur)."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Lipéad mór. Ailias fhada de `-size-lg`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag."
msgstr "Lipéad mór."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag."
msgstr "Lipéad beag."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Lipéad beag. Ailias fhada de `-size-sm`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag."
msgstr "Léiríonn sé an giúlfán díshuiteála ag an deireadh ar lipéad inlíne is féidir a dhíchur."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — The read-only label-chip counterpart."
msgstr "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — An chomhpháirt lipéad-slisín léithe amháin."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: testimonial"
msgstr ""

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Taispeáint luachan nó moladh le cur i leith agus íomhánna roghnacha."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "✅ Úsáid Testimonial nuair:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying customer or user testimonials and quotes\n- You want to highlight a statement with visual emphasis\n- Attribution and context (name, title, image) are important\n🚫 Don't use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "- Ag taispeáint moladh nó tuairimí custaiméara/úsáideora agus luachana\n- Ba mhaith leat béim a chur ar ráiteas le léiriú amhairc\n- Tá cur i leith agus comhthéacs (ainm, teideal, íomhá) tábhachtach\n🚫 Ná húsáid Testimonial nuair:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying inline quotes in body text — use a blockquote element instead\n- The statement is the main focus — use Hero or Card instead"
msgstr "- Ag taispeáint luachana san líne laistigh den téacs — bain úsáid as eilimint blockquote ina áit\n- Is é an ráiteas an príomhfhócas — bain úsáid as Hero nó Card ina áit"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use `<blockquote>` semantically for the quote\n- Ensure attribution is clear and associated with the quote\n- If using images, provide alt text"
msgstr "- Úsáid `<blockquote>` go seimeantúil don luachan\n- Déan cinnte go bhfuil an cur i leith soiléir agus nasctha leis an luachan\n- Má tá íomhánna in úsáid, cuir téacs alt ar fáil"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Attribution author name."
msgstr "Ainm an údair don chur i leith."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author profile image."
msgstr "Íomhá próifíle údair roghnach."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for quote and attribution."
msgstr "Coimeádán don luachan agus don chur i leith."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The quoted text."
msgstr "An téacs a luadh."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author title or affiliation."
msgstr "Teideal nó aitheantas údair roghnach."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-area"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-area` — A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "`.instui-text-area` — `<textarea>` dúchasach stílithe, in-athraitheach sa mhéid, leis na stáit agus na toisí céanna leis an ionchur téacs."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and focus states with `text-input` and `simple-select`; only `resize: vertical` and the taller minimum height are unique to it."
msgstr "Roinneann sé a bhord, a chúlra agus a stáit fhócas le `text-input` agus `simple-select`; níl ach `resize: vertical` agus an airde íosta níos airde uathúil dó."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — The single-line counterpart with the same states and sizes."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — An comhpháirt aonlíne leis na stáit agus na toisí céanna."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-input` — A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-text-input` — `<input>` dúchais stílithe — lena n-áirítear `date`, `time`, agus `datetime-local`, áit a soláthraíonn an brabhsálaí an roghnóir — le stáidí bailíochta agus méideanna."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and state chrome with `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input`, and `input-group`; for `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` types the browser supplies its own picker UI, which this stylesheet doesn't style."
msgstr "Roinntear a theorainn, a chúlra agus an chrome stáit leis `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input` agus `input-group`; do chineálacha `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` soláthraíonn an brabhsálaí a chomhéadan roghnóra féin, nach ndéantar stíl air sa stílshíniú seo."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — The multi-line counterpart with the same states and sizes.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The numeric-entry input sharing this chrome.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — The native select sharing this field chrome.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Wraps this input with leading and trailing slots."
msgstr "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — An comhthéacs illíneach leis na stáidí agus na méideanna céanna.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — An ionchur iontrála uimhriúil a roinneann an chrome seo.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — An roghnóir dúchasach a roinneann an chrome réimse seo.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Pacálann an grúpa ionchuir seo an ionchur le sliotáin tosaigh agus deiridh."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text"
msgstr ""

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Tíopagrafaíocht téacs-comhlacht le méid, meáchan, dath agus modhnóirí stíle."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets and the `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` modifiers all compose on the same element; unlike `heading`, it renders no implicit semantic level."
msgstr "Tá na réamhshocruithe `-variant-*` agus na modhnóirí `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` go léir inúsáidte ar an eilimint chéanna; in éagmais `heading`, ní chuirtear aon leibhéal seirmeantach intuigthe i bhfeidhm."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text/text.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text/text.css)"

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-color-ai-highlight`."
msgstr ""

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
