#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success text colour."
msgstr "Dath téacs rathúlachta."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning text colour."
msgstr "Dath téacs rabhaidh."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Italic."
msgstr "Ísléirithe (italic)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Capitalise each word."
msgstr "Céadaigh gach focal (Capitalise each word)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lowercase the text."
msgstr "Léasair an téacs go litreacha beagáinín (lowercase the text)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Uppercase the text."
msgstr "Léasair an téacs go litreacha móra (uppercase the text)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Content type preset."
msgstr "Réamhshocrú cineál ábhair."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Important-content type preset."
msgstr "Réamhshocrú cineál ábhair tábhachtach."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Quote-content type preset."
msgstr "Réamhshocrú cineál ábhair luachaire (quote)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small-content type preset."
msgstr "Réamhshocrú cineál ábhair bheag."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page-description type preset."
msgstr "Réamhshocrú cineál cur síos leathanach."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Section-description type preset."
msgstr "Réamhshocrú cineál cur síos alt."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Legend type preset."
msgstr "Réamhshocrú cineál finscéal (legend)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bold weight."
msgstr "Meáchan dána (Bold)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [heading](/api/css/heading.md) — Typography for headings rather than body text.\n- [truncate](/api/css/truncate.md) — Clips this text to one line or a set number of lines."
msgstr "- [heading](/api/css/heading.md) — Tíopagrafaíocht do cheanntásca seachas téacs comhlachta.\n- [truncate](/api/css/truncate.md) — Gearrann an téacs seo go líne amháin nó go líon sonraithe línte."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-details"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-details` — A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-details` — Fógra nochtaithe dúchais stílithe `<details>` le chevron rothlach."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the native `<details>` element, so the browser drives open and close plus keyboard support; the CSS only hides the default marker and supplies the rotating chevron."
msgstr "Tógtha ar an eilimint dúchais `<details>`, mar sin is é an brabhsálaí a thiomáineann oscailt agus dúnadh agus tacaíocht méarchláir; ní cheiltíonn an CSS ach an marcóir réamhshocraithe agus soláthraíonn sé an chevron rothlach."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the chevron after the summary."
msgstr "Cuir an chevron i ndiaidh na hachoimre."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filled (surface) variant."
msgstr "Leagan líonta (dromchla)."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the disclosure is open."
msgstr "Tarraingíonn sé chevron nochtaithe na hachoimre, glyf mhaiscáilte a rothlaíonn chun treo síos nuair a bhíonn an nochtadh oscailte."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — The bordered, grouped form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — An fhoirm ghrúpáilte le teorainn den nochtadh céanna."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-group` — A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-group` — Nochtadh le teorainn bunaithe ar `<details>`: sraith achoimre le chevrón agus ábhar inaistrithe."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the same native `<details>` foundation as toggle-details; put the `<summary>` first so it becomes the clickable header row and the rest is the collapsible content."
msgstr "Tógtha ar an mbunús dúchais `<details>` céanna le toggle-details; cuir an `<summary>` ar dtús ionas go mbeidh sé ina shraith cheannais cliceáilte agus go mbeidh an chuid eile mar ábhar inaistrithe."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary row's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the group is open."
msgstr "Tarraingíonn sé chevrón nochtaithe sraithe achoimre, glíf faoi scáth a rothlaíonn chun síos nuair a bhíonn an grúpa oscailte."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — The single, unbordered form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — An fhoirm aonair, gan teorainn den nochtadh céanna."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tooltip"
msgstr ""

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tooltip` — A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "`.instui-tooltip` — Bublóg tooltip CSS le hover agus fócas, is féidir í a shocrú ar aon thaobh."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Toggling is pure CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), so the bubble only reaches keyboard users through a focusable trigger; unlike `popover`, it isn't dismissible or click-triggered."
msgstr "Is CSS ghlan é an lascáil (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), mar sin ní fhaigheann ach úsáideoirí méarchláir rochtain ar an bublóg trí spreagthóir infhócasaithe; murach `popover`, níl sé in-mhúchta ná spreagtha le cliceáil."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Point the trigger at the bubble with aria-describedby and give the bubble role=\"tooltip\"."
msgstr "Dírigh an spreagthóir chuig an bublóg leis an aria-describedby agus tabhair role=\"tooltip\" don bublóg."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a trigger glyph icon next to the tooltip bubble."
msgstr "Léirigh íocón glyf spreagthóra in aice leis an bublóg tooltip."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The bubble; `-placement-*` sets its side."
msgstr "An bublóg; socraíonn `-placement-*` a thaobh."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The larger, click-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — An dromchla nasctha níos mó, spreagtha le cliceáil.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Dromchla nasctha gaolmhar le táscaire."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: transition"
msgstr ""

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Ranna staid beochana don chomhpháirt `Transition` — `.instui-transition` agus ranna staid (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, srl.) — inúsáidte ina n-aonar nó nasctha ar aon chomhpháirt."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Transition type/state class toggled by runtime (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."
msgstr "Cineál aistrithe/rang staid a athraítear le linn rith an chláir (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state."
msgstr "Fad an bheochana (réamhshocraithe `300ms`); cuir in áit é chun gach staid aistrithe a luasghéarú nó a moilliú."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`)."
msgstr "Feidhm ama an bheochana (réamhshocraithe `ease-in-out`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tray` — An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "`.instui-tray` — Painéal greamaithe ar an imeall a sleamhnaíonn isteach ó aon thaobh; `[popover]` nó `<dialog>` dúchais."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start/end placements resolve against `inset-inline` (logical, direction-aware); the slide-in transform mirrors automatically under an ancestor `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, so no extra markup is needed for right-to-left layouts."
msgstr "Réitítear suíomhanna tosaigh/deiridh i gcoinne `inset-inline` (loighciúil, aireach treoracha); déanann an t-athrú sleamhnaithe-in macasamhail go huathoibríoch faoi `[dir=\"rtl\"]` sean-athar, mar sin níl marcáil bhreise ag teastáil do leaganacha deas-go-chlé."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The tray is a dialog or popover surface, so name it with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`, and its close control carries an `aria-label` (the `.instui-close-button` in the example uses `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "Is dromchla dialóige nó popover é an tray, mar sin ainmníoidh tú é le `aria-label` nó `aria-labelledby`, agus tá `aria-label` ar a rialtóir dúnadh (úsáideann an `.instui-close-button` sa shampla `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the bottom edge."
msgstr "Greamaigh chuig an imeall íochtarach."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the end (inline-end) edge."
msgstr "Greamaigh chuig an imeall deiridh (inline-end)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Pin to the start (inline-start) edge."
msgstr "(réamhshocraithe) Greamaigh chuig an imeall tosaigh (inline-start)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the top edge."
msgstr "Greamaigh chuig an imeall uachtarach."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-size-md`."
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Opens with the native `[popover]` API and `@starting-style`; the slide-in sits behind an `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` guard, so browsers without it still open the tray, just without the slide."
msgstr "- Osclaíonn sé leis an API dúchais `[popover]` agus `@starting-style`; tá an sleamhnán suite taobh thiar de garda `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)`, mar sin osclaíonn brabhsálaithe nach bhfuil é seo acu an tray fós, ach gan an sleamhnán."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — The same dismissible overlay pattern, centred instead of edge-pinned.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer surface this builds on."
msgstr "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — An patrún clúdach indíothaithe céanna, lárnach seachas greamaithe ar an imeall.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — An dromchla sraithe uachtair ghinearálta ar a bhfuil sé bunaithe."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tree-browser"
msgstr ""

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tree-browser` — A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "`.instui-tree-browser` — Crann nochtaithe de bhailiúcháin shnáitheacha agus míreanna duille, le chevrons ag rothlú."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each collection is a native `<details>`; nesting them inside one another builds the tree, and the browser handles opening and closing every branch."
msgstr "Is `<details>` dúchais iad gach bailiúchán; trí iad a shnú isteach i gceann eile tógann tú an crann, agus tá an brabhsálaí freagrach as gach géag a oscailt agus a dhúnadh."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the root with role=\"tree\" and each nested list with role=\"group\"."
msgstr "Marcáil an fréamh le role=\"tree\" agus gach liosta faoi-nithe le role=\"group\"."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render folder/file glyph icons in summaries and leaf items."
msgstr "Taispeáin deilbhíní glyf fillteán/comhad sna achoimrí agus i míreanna duille."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A leaf entry in the tree."
msgstr "Iontráil duille sa chrann."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws each collection's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the branch is open."
msgstr "Tarraingíonn sé chevron nochtaithe gach bailiúcháin — glyf faoi mhasca a rothlaíonn chun síos nuair a bhíonn an géag ar oscailt."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries."
msgstr "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Tá iontrálacha shnáitheacha roghnach ag an mbeirt."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: truncate"
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "`.--truncate` — gearradh le haistrithe trí chliblíne a rialaítear ag `--lines` — infheidhme beo nó nasctha ar aon chomhpháirt (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base class uses `display: -webkit-box` and reads the `--lines` custom property to clamp text to a fixed number of lines before it ends in an ellipsis."
msgstr "Úsáideann an rang bunúsach `display: -webkit-box` agus léann sé an mhaoin shaincheaptha `--lines` chun téacs a chliblú go líon seasmhach línte sula dtéann sé i ndeireadh le haistrithe."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "JS Requirement"
msgstr "Riachtanas JS"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component ships no CSS of its own — its markup and behavior come entirely from `@pantoken/interactions`. Its `--max-lines-auto` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "Ní sheolann an chomhpháirt seo CSS dá chuid féin — tagann a mharcáil agus a iompar go hiomlán ó `@pantoken/interactions`. Tiomáineann an modhnóir `--max-lines-auto` an iompar sin. Féach an [tábla modhnóirí thíos](#modifiers)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-1`."
msgstr "Ailias de `--max-lines-1`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-2`."
msgstr "Ailias de `--max-lines-2`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-3`."
msgstr "Ailias de `--max-lines-3`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-4`."
msgstr "Ailias de `--max-lines-4`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-5`."
msgstr "Ailias de `--max-lines-5`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to one line (default)."
msgstr "Cliblaigh go líne amháin (réamhshocraithe)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to two lines."
msgstr "Cliblaigh go dhá líne."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to three lines."
msgstr "Cliblaigh go trí líne."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to four lines."
msgstr "Cliblaigh go ceithre líne."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to five lines."
msgstr "Cliblaigh go cúig líne."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — — Clamp to the number of lines that fit in the container, based on its height and the line height of the text."
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enables truncation and line clamping on the target element."
msgstr "Cumasóidh sé gearradh agus cliblhú línte ar an eilimint sprioc."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Truncate at the character level."
msgstr "(réamhshocraithe) Gearr ag leibhéal an charachtair."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Truncate at the word level."
msgstr "Gearr ag leibhéal an fhocail."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Clamping relies on `-webkit-line-clamp` with `display: -webkit-box`, paired with the standard `line-clamp`."
msgstr "- Braitheann clibhlú ar `-webkit-line-clamp` le `display: -webkit-box`, in éineacht leis an gcaighdeán `line-clamp`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography that this truncates."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Cineáltaí comhlachta don choirp a ghearrtar seo."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: two-column"
msgstr ""

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Leagan dhá-cholún le réigiúin ábhair clé agus deas."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "✅ Úsáid Two-Column nuair:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You have two content areas of roughly equal importance\n- Comparing or contrasting two sets of content side-by-side\n- Building a responsive layout that stacks on mobile\n🚫 Don't use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "- Tá dhá réimse ábhair agat atá beagnach chomh tábhachtach\n- Ag comparáid nó ag contrárú dhá shraith ábhair taobh le taobh\n- Ag tógáil leagan freagrúil a shraitheann ar ghléasanna soghluaiste\n🚫 Ná húsáid Two-Column nuair:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- One column dominates the page — use asymmetric layout instead\n- Content doesn't benefit from side-by-side presentation"
msgstr "- Tá colún amháin ag smachtú an leathanaigh — bain úsáid as leagan neamhchothrom ina ionad\n- Ní fhaigheann an t-ábhar buntáiste ó thaispeáint taobh le taobh"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure both columns are perceivable and usable on narrow viewports\n- Use semantic landmarks (e.g., `<section>`) to wrap column content\n- Maintain sufficient space and contrast between columns"
msgstr "- Déan cinnte go bhfuil an dá cholún inléite agus úsáideach ar radhairc tanaí\n- Úsáid marcálacha shiomantacha (m.sh., `<section>`) chun ábhar an cholúin a fhilleadh\n- Coinnigh spás agus codarsnacht leordhóthanach idir na colúin"

