#: css/visual-debug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.-with-visual-debug` — A layout-debugging outline: compound `.-with-visual-debug` onto any element to outline the box and its immediate children, so a layout's structure is visible at a glance."
msgstr "`.-with-visual-debug` — Dríothlínn dífhabhtaithe leagan amach: cuir `.-with-visual-debug` i gcomhdhéanamh ar aon eilimint chun bosca agus a pháistí láithreach a leagan amach le línte, ionas go mbeidh struchtúr an leagan amach le feiceáil láithreach."

#: css/visual-debug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Group:** Plugins · **Source:** [visual-debug.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/visual-debug/visual-debug.css)"
msgstr "**Grúpa:** Plugins · **Foinse:** [visual-debug.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/visual-debug/visual-debug.css)"

#: css/visual-debug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The outline colour (default a bright magenta); retint it to change every debug outline."
msgstr "Dath na dríothlínne (réamhshocraithe: magenta geal); athdathaigh é chun gach dríothlínn dífhabhtaithe a athrú."

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: wrapper"
msgstr ""

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — Sraith app-shell: nascleanúin taobh, coimeádán le ceannlíne, agus painéal roghnach."

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "✅ Úsáid Wrapper nuair a:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "- Ag tógáil leathanach táirgí iomlán Canvas a dteastaíonn cliabhán leaganaithe comhsheasmhach uaidh\n- Úsáideann an leathanach GlobalNav mar an príomh-anchór nascleanúna\n- Tá gá le painéil thaobh: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, nó UtilityPanel\n- Tá gá le padding coimeádáin comhsheasmhach agus leithead uasta ábhair trasna an leathanaigh iomláin\n🚫 Ná húsáid Wrapper nuair a:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
msgstr "- Ag tógáil Modal, Tray, nó Drawer — tá coimeádáin leaganaithe féin acu sin\n- Ag clúdach fo-earnáil de leathanach — cuimsíonn Wrapper an leathanach iomlán, ní réigiún amháin"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
msgstr "- Léirigh an príomh-áit ábhair mar lárionad &lt;main&gt; le nasc skip-nav ionas gur féidir le húsáideoirí méarchláir GlobalNav a sheachaint\n- Tabhair ról ContentTabList=\"navigation\" le aria-label ar leith amhail \"Page navigation\" — ar leith ó lárionad GlobalNav\n- Tabhair ról TrailingContentArea=\"complementary\" le aria-label cur síosach a léiríonn a chuid ábhar, mar \"Sonraí mac léinn\"\n- Tabhair aria-label ar leith do gach UtilityPanel: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", nó \"Filters\"\n- Nuair a osclaítear UtilityPanel, bog fócas isteach sa phainéal; nuair a dhúnann sé, tabhair an fócas ar ais don spreagadh a d'oscail é"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Primary page content."
msgstr "Príomh-ábhar an leathanaigh."

