msgstr "`@pantoken/figma` — an IR token Instructure a thiontú go payload Sainroghanna Figma."

#: design/figma/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It produces one variable collection with `light`/`dark` modes: colour tokens become `COLOR`\nvariables (RGBA 0–1), dimensions/numbers become `FLOAT`, everything else `STRING`. Icons are\nexcluded (they'd be Figma components, not variables). Feed [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) to a Figma\nplugin (the Variables plugin API) or the Variables REST API — the README has the plugin glue."
msgstr "Tá sé ag táirgeadh bailiúcháin athróige amháin le módanna `light`/`dark`: éiríonn tokenna dathanna ina `COLOR`\nathróga (RGBA 0–1), éiríonn tomhais/uimhreacha ina `FLOAT`, agus bíonn gach rud eile ina `STRING`. Tá íomhánna eisiacha\n(bheadh siad ina chomhpháirteanna Figma, ní ina athróga). Cuir [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) i bpluigín Figma\n(API pluigín Variables) nó ar an Variables REST API — tá an README leis an nasc idir an pluigín."

#: design/figma/src/index.md
