msgid "Swatches are a flat reduction of the tokens to named colours, delivered *directly to a designer*\nto import into their tool. This is not an interchange format (use `@pantoken/dtcg` or\n`@pantoken/figma` for that) — it's a terminal palette file: Adobe ASE, GIMP `.gpl`, or Sketch\n`.sketchpalette`."
msgstr "Is laghdú díreach ar na tóicíní iad na samhlacha dathanna go dathanna ainmnithe, seolta *go díreach chuig dearthóir*\nle hionchur isteach ina n-uirlis. Ní formáid mhalartaithe í seo (úsáid `@pantoken/dtcg` nó\n`@pantoken/figma` chuige sin) — is comhad pailéad críochnaithe é: Adobe ASE, GIMP `.gpl`, nó Sketch\n`.sketchpalette`."

