#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# css"
msgstr "# css"

#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/css` — emit Instructure design tokens as `@property`-typed CSS."
msgstr "`@pantoken/css` — seolann sé na tóicní dearadh Instructure mar CSS cineálta `@property`."

#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) turns any token IR into CSS; [css](variables/css.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` stylesheet and\n[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) is a lean variant that drops the full `--instui-icon-*` set (the ~1,777 icon data-URIs\nthat dominate the sheet) for CDN/embed delivery — ~a sixth the size over the wire. Both carry the\nelevation + focus-outline foundation (composite custom properties whose pure builders live in\n`@pantoken/utils`), so a component sheet resolves its shadows and focus ring against the token sheet\nalone. A DOM side-effect entry lives at `@pantoken/css/inject`; static files at\n`@pantoken/css/style.css` and `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) iompraíonn aon IR tóicní go CSS; [css](variables/css.md) is é an stíleagán `rebrand` réidh agus\n[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) is éagsúlacht shimplí é a fhágann den bhailiúchán iomlán `--instui-icon-*` (na ~1,777 URIí sonraí íocón\na nglactar an sheet) do sheachadadh CDN/ionchur — thart ar séú cuid den mhéid ar an ngreille. Tá an bonn ardaigh + fáinne fócas (airíonna saincheaptha comhdhlúite ina bhfuil tógálaithe glan ina gcónaí i\n`@pantoken/utils`), mar sin réitíonn stíleagán comhpháirte a scáthanna agus fáinne fócas i gcoinne an stíleagáin tóicní\namháin. Tá iontráil éifeacht-taobh DOM ag `@pantoken/css/inject`; comhaid statacha ag\n`@pantoken/css/style.css` agus `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."

#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [css](variables/css.md)"
msgstr "Athainmníonn agus onnmhairíonn arís [css](variables/css.md)"

