msgid "Stroke-based glyphs (Lucide) are outlined to fills so they render as real font glyphs; fill-based\nglyphs (Instructure custom) pass through."
msgstr "Déantar glichfhoirmeacha bunaithe ar tharraingt (Lucide) a thiontú go líonadh ionas go n-taispeántar iad mar ghlicfhoirmeacha carachtair fhíor don chló; rithfidh glichfhoirmeacha bunaithe ar líonadh (Instructure custom) tríd gan athrú."

