msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Release a ProgressCircle's mount-animation modifier after its configured delay."
msgstr "Scaoil an modhnóir mount-animation de ProgressCircle tar éis a mhoill shonraithe."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The delay is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless\n`--animation-delay` custom property. Missing, negative, and non-finite values become zero. Both the\ncanonical modifier and its deprecated typo alias are accepted and removed."
msgstr "Is rogha milliseicind shonrach an mhoill nó airí ríomhtha, gan aon aonad an spriocárais\n`--animation-delay` airí shaincheaptha. Éiríonn luachanna atá in easnamh, diúltacha, agus neamhtheoranta ina nialas. Glactar leis an\nmodhnóir caighdeánach agus lena ailias typo seanmhaireannach agus baintear iad."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### target"
msgstr "### target"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initRemove()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: initRemove()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove a target after a timeout. Before removal, fires a cancelable, bubbling `dismiss` event.\nPreventing that event keeps the target mounted."
msgstr "Baintear sprioc tar éis ama imeachta. Roimh an bhaint, seoltar eachtra in-annfhéideartha, ag scaipeadh `dismiss`.\nMá chuireann tú cosc ar an eachtra sin, fanfaidh an sprioc suiteáilte."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The timeout is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless `--timeout` CSS\ncustom property. Missing, non-finite, and non-positive values don't arm a timer. A fade uses the\n`@pantoken/components` `transition` utility's classes (`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`), then waits\nfor `transitionend` (with a fallback); `transition: \"none\"` removes immediately."
msgstr "Is rogha shonrach i mílisóicindí é an ama imeachta nó airíonna saincheaptha CSS ríomhta don sprioc gan aon aonad: `--timeout`.\nNí ghnóthaíonn amchlóg má tá an luach ar iarraidh, mura bhfuil sé fíor-theoranta, nó mura bhfuil sé dearfach. Úsáideann éadromú (fade) ranganna na háise `@pantoken/components` `transition` (`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`), ansin fanann sé ar `transitionend` (le réiteach cúltaca); baintear `transition: \"none\"` láithreach."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initResponsiveOverlay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initResponsiveOverlay()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: initResponsiveOverlay()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initResponsiveOverlay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire open/close commands plus width-based responsive overlay switching onto a host: any\ncollapsible side panel (e.g. a drawer's tray) can import this interaction rather than each\ncomponent reimplementing it."
msgstr "Sreangáil orduithe oscailte/dún agus lasctha freagrach bunaithe ar leithead ar óstach: is féidir le haon\nphainéal taobh inchoiscithe (m.sh. tráidire an tarraiceáin) an idirghníomhú seo a iompórtáil seachas gach\nchomhpháirt é a athfhorbairt."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initTooltip()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: initTooltip()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire hover/focus show-hide with delay onto a tooltip wrapper and its tip\nbubble. Returns a cleanup function for use in web component disconnectedCallback."
msgstr "Ceangail taispeáint/folaigh nuair atá an luch os cionn nó nuair a bhíonn fócas (hover/focus) le moill ar chlúdach tooltip agus ar a ‘tip bubble’. Fillteann sé feidhm ghlantacháin le húsáid i disconnectedCallback chomhpháirte ghréasáin."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  wrapper = .instui-tooltip element, tip = its .tip child\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"
msgstr "  CSS:  wrapper = eilimint .instui-tooltip, tip = a pháiste .tip\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### wrapper"
msgstr "### wrapper"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### tip"
msgstr "### tip"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTruncateAuto.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initTruncateAuto()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: initTruncateAuto()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTruncateAuto.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep `--lines` in sync with available height for an auto-clamped truncate target."
msgstr "Coinnigh `--lines` i gcomhthreo leis an airde atá ar fáil don sprioc truncáilte uathoibríoch."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTruncateAuto.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- CSS usage: pass the same element as `host` and `target`.\n- Web-component usage: pass custom-element host + shadow truncate target span."
msgstr "- Úsáid CSS: cuir an eilimint chéanna mar `host` agus `target`.\n- Úsáid comhlacht gréasáin: cuir óstach an eilimint shain agus an span sprioc truncála sa scáth."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/makeOnCommand.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: makeOnCommand()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: makeOnCommand()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/makeOnCommand.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the `command`-event router: forward a target's `command` events to a handler, and where the\nInvoker Commands API is missing, delegate matching `commandfor` clicks across the target's tree."
msgstr "Tóg an ródaire ócáide `command`: tarchuigh ócáidí `command` an sprioc chuig láimhseálaí, agus nuair nach bhfuil\nAPI na nOrdaithe Invoker ar fáil, cuir cliceáilí `commandfor` comhoiriúnacha ar aghaidh trasna chrann an sprioc."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/makeOnCommand.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### invokerSupported"
msgstr "### invokerSupported"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/resolveSpace.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: resolveSpace()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: resolveSpace()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/resolveSpace.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve one spacing value: keyword alias to token, otherwise pass through unchanged."
msgstr "Réitigh luach spáis amháin: alias eochairfhocail go token, mura amhlaidh pasáil tríd gan athrú."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/spacingValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: spacingValue()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: spacingValue()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/spacingValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve a 1-4 value InstUI spacing shorthand (`margin`/`padding`) to its CSS value."
msgstr "Réitigh giorrúchán spásála InstUI le 1–4 luach (`margin`/`padding`) go dtí a luach CSS."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/spacingValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### attr"
msgstr "### attr"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/syncInvoker.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: syncInvoker()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: syncInvoker()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/syncInvoker.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mirror the host's invoker attributes onto its inner `<button>`'s IDL properties, resolving ids\nagainst the host's root so a shadow-DOM button can drive a light-DOM `[popover]`/command target."
msgstr "Mirror the host's invoker attributes onto its inner `&lt;button&gt;`'s IDL properties, resolving ids\nagainst the host's root so a shadow-DOM button can drive a light-DOM `[popover]`/command target."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/syncTruncateAutoLines.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: syncTruncateAutoLines()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: syncTruncateAutoLines()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/syncTruncateAutoLines.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compute and apply a numeric `--lines` value from available height."
msgstr "Ríomh agus cuir i bhfeidhm luach `--lines` uimhriúil ó airde atá ar fáil."

#: formats/interactions/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# interactions"
msgstr "# interactions"

#: formats/interactions/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/interactions` - per-component interaction bundles for InstUI components."
msgstr "`@pantoken/interactions` - pacáistí idirghníomhaíochta in aghaidh an chomhpháirte do chomhpháirteanna InstUI."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CommandEventish"
msgstr "# Comhéadan: CommandEventish"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `command`/`source` shape of an Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (not yet in DOM lib types)."
msgstr "Cruth `command`/`source` de `CommandEvent` Ordaitheoirí Invoker (níl i gcomhthéacs DOM lib types fós)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### command"
msgstr "### command"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### source"
msgstr "### source"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### bubbles"
msgstr "### bubbles"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`bubbles`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event bubbles up through the DOM tree or not."
msgstr "Léiríonn an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`bubbles`** den chomhéadan Event an bhfuil an t-imeacht ag múnlú suas trí chrann DOM nó nach bhfuil."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~cancelBubble~~"
msgstr "### ~~cancelBubble~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "Tá an mhaoin **`cancelBubble`** den chomhéadan Event seanbhunaithe. Úsáid Event.stopPropagation() ina áit. Má chuireann tú a luach mar true sula bhfilltear ó láimhseálaí imeachta cuireann sé cosc ar shraonadh an imeachta. I bhfeidhmeanna níos déanaí, níl aon éifeacht ag é a shocrú mar false. Féach Comhoiriúnacht Brabhsálaí le sonraí."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Deprecated"
msgstr "#### As dáta"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cancelable"
msgstr "### cancelable"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelable`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event can be canceled, and therefore prevented as if the event never happened."
msgstr "Taispeánann an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`cancelable`** den chomhéadan Event an féidir an t-imeacht a chealú, agus dá bhrí sin a chosc mar nár tharla an t-imeacht riamh."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composed"
msgstr "### composed"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "Tugann an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`composed`** den chomhéadan Event luach boolean a léiríonn an mbeidh an t-imeacht ag sraonadh thar teorainn shadow DOM isteach sa DOM caighdeánach nó nach mbeidh."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### currentTarget"
msgstr "### currentTarget"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "Aitheann an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`currentTarget`** den chomhéadan Event an eilimint ar ceapadh an láimhseálaí imeachta uirthi."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### defaultPrevented"
msgstr "### defaultPrevented"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "Tugann an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`defaultPrevented`** den chomhéadan Event luach boolean a léiríonn an ndearna glao ar Event.preventDefault() an t-imeacht a chealú nó nach ndearna."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### eventPhase"
msgstr "### eventPhase"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "Léiríonn an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`eventPhase`** den chomhéadan Event cén chéim den shruth imeachta atá á mheas faoi láthair."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### isTrusted"
msgstr "### isTrusted"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "Is luach boolean í an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`isTrusted`** den chomhéadan Event a bhíonn true nuair a gineadh an t-imeacht ag an ngníomhaire úsáideora (lena n-áirítear trí ghníomhartha úsáideora agus modhanna clárúcháin mar HTMLElement.focus()), agus bréagach nuair a cuireadh an t-imeacht trí EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). An eisceacht amháin ná imeacht click, a shocríonn an mhaoin isTrusted mar false i ngníomhaireoirí úsáideora."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~returnValue~~"
msgstr "### ~~returnValue~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "Taispeánann an mhaoin Event **`returnValue`** an bhfuil an gníomh réamhshocraithe don imeacht seo coscaithe nó nach bhfuil."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~srcElement~~"
msgstr "### ~~srcElement~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "Is ailt-eisimirc é an **`Event.srcElement`** seanbhunaithe don Airíonna Event.target. Úsáid Event.target ina áit."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "Is tagairt í an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`target`** den chomhéadan Event don réad ar a seoladh an t-imeacht. Tá sé difriúil ó Event.currentTarget nuair a ghlaoitear an láimhseálaí imeachta le linn chéim ghreamaithe nó scagtha an imeachta."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### timeStamp"
msgstr "### timeStamp"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "Tugann an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`timeStamp`** den chomhéadan Event an t-am (i milliseicindí) ag a cruthaíodh an t-imeacht."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "Tugann an mhaoin léitheoireachta-dhíreach **`type`** den chomhéadan Event sreang ina bhfuil cineál an imeachta. Socraítear é nuair a dheantar an t-imeacht agus is é an t-ainm a úsáidtear go coitianta chun tagairt a dhéanamh don imeacht ar leith, mar shampla click, load, nó error."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### NONE"
msgstr "### NONE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### AT\\_TARGET"
msgstr "### AT\\_TARGET"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composedPath()"
msgstr "### composedPath()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`composedPath()`** method of the Event interface returns the event's path which is an array of the objects on which listeners will be invoked. This does not include nodes in shadow trees if the shadow root was created with its ShadowRoot.mode closed."
msgstr "Tugann an modh **`composedPath()`** den chomhéadan Event cosán an imeachta ar ais, is é sin eagar na réada ar ar ghlaofar lucht éisteachta. Ní chuimsíonn sé seo nóid i gcrainn scáth más cruthaíodh fréamh an scáth le ShadowRoot.mode dúnta."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~initEvent()~~"
msgstr "### ~~initEvent()~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`Event.initEvent()`** method is used to initialize the value of an event created using Document.createEvent()."
msgstr "Úsáidtear an modh **`Event.initEvent()`** chun luach imeachta a thosú a cruthaíodh ag baint úsáide as Document.createEvent()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### type"
msgstr "##### type"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### bubbles?"
msgstr "##### bubbles?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### cancelable?"
msgstr "##### cancelable?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### preventDefault()"
msgstr "### preventDefault()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`preventDefault()`** method of the Event interface tells the user agent that the event is being explicitly handled, so its default action, such as page scrolling, link navigation, or pasting text, should not be taken."
msgstr "Cuireann an modh **`preventDefault()`** den chomhéadan Event in iúl don ghníomhaire úsáideora go bhfuil an t-imeacht á láimhseáil go sainráite, mar sin níor chóir a ngníomh réamhshocraithe, mar shampla scrolláil leathanach, nascleanúint nasc, nó paste téacs, a ghlacadh."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### stopImmediatePropagation()"
msgstr "### stopImmediatePropagation()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents other listeners of the same event from being called."
msgstr "Cuireann an modh **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** den chomhéadan Event cosc ar lucht éisteachta eile don imeacht céanna a ghlaoch."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### stopPropagation()"
msgstr "### stopPropagation()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopPropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents further propagation of the current event in the capturing and bubbling phases. It does not, however, prevent any default behaviors from occurring; for instance, clicks on links are still processed. If you want to stop those behaviors, see the preventDefault() method. It also does not prevent propagation to other event-handlers of the current element. If you want to stop those, see stopImmediatePropagation()."
msgstr "Cuireann an modh **`stopPropagation()`** den chomhéadan Event cosc ar shraonadh níos mó den imeacht reatha le linn na gcéimeanna ghabhála agus buibhlithe. Ní chuireann sé cosc, áfach, ar iompar réamhshocraithe ar siúl; mar shampla, próiseálfar cliceáil ar nasc fós. Má theastaíonn duit stop a chur ar an iompar sin, féach an modh preventDefault(). Ní chuireann sé freisin cosc ar shraonadh chuig láimhseálaithe imeachta eile ar an eilimint reatha. Má theastaíonn sin uait, féach stopImmediatePropagation()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: ProgressCircleHandle"
msgstr "# Comhéadan: ProgressCircleHandle"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Handle returned by [initProgressCircle](../functions/initProgressCircle.md)."
