msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: DeprecationEntry"
msgstr "# Comhéadan: DeprecationEntry"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One entry in the token deprecation ledger — the lifecycle of a single dropped upstream token."
msgstr "Aon iontráil i leabhar taifead díothaithe token — saolré token aonair a scaoileadh ón upstream."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A shim value comes from EITHER `replacement` (emit `var(replacement)`, so theming flows through) OR\n`value` (freeze the last-known literal, when the drop has no canonical replacement). Exactly one is\nexpected; an entry with neither emits no shim."
msgstr "Tagann luach shim ó EITHER `replacement` (seol `var(replacement)`, ionas go sruthaíonn téama tríd) NÓ `value` (reothann an litir dheireanach a raibh a fhios uirthi, nuair nach bhfuil athsholáthar caighdeánach ag an scaoileadh). Ceaptar go mbeidh go díreach ceann amháin; ní thaispeánfaidh iontráil gan ceann acu shim ar bith."

