#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — build and compose pantoken plugins, with capability-aware registration."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — tógáil agus comhdhéanamh breiseán pantoken, le clárú atá feasach ar chumasanna."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) is the modern factory: pass the hooks you implement and it returns a normal\n`PantokenPlugin` branded with the capabilities inferred from those hooks. Consumers\n(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) run [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) to warn — never error — when a plugin is\nregistered where it has no effect: a non-factoried plugin (capability checks unavailable) or a\nfactoried plugin at a stage it doesn't implement (e.g. a token-only plugin passed to `toCss`)."
msgstr "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) is é an mhonarcha nua-aimseartha: pasáil na hooks a chuireann tú i bhfeidhm agus filleann sé `PantokenPlugin` gnáth a bhfuil branda leis na cumais a mheastar ó na hooks sin. Ritheann tomhaltóirí (`buildTokens`, `toCss`) [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) chun rabhaidh a thabhairt — ní rithfear earráid riamh — nuair a chláraítear breiseán áit nach bhfuil éifeacht aige: breiseán neamh-factoraite (seicní cumais nach bhfuil ar fáil) nó breiseán factoraite ag céim nach gcuirtear i ngníomh é (m.sh. breiseán d’fhéin-thóicíní a pasáiltear chuig `toCss`)."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transform stages a `plugins:` array actually drives are `tokens`, `icons`, and `css`; `rehype`\n(a render-time icon resolver) and `native` (Style Dictionary) are recorded as capabilities but are\ndownstream consumers, not guarded here."
msgstr "Na céimeanna tiontaithe a thiomáineann iarratas `plugins:` ná `tokens`, `icons` agus `css`; tá `rehype` (réiteach lógó ag am a léirithe) agus `native` (Style Dictionary) scríofa mar chumasanna ach is tomhaltóirí i bhforbairt iad, ní rialaithe anseo."

