#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# utils"
msgstr "# utils"

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/utils` — shared, upstream-free helpers used across the pantoken packages: the token\nreference resolver (with `light-dark()` handling), the two token regexes (typed via `arkregex`),\nkebab→camel case, hex-colour parsing, SVG sanitization, the pantoken spacing scale, reference-drift\nvalidation, and the generic token→utility-class emitters that both `@pantoken/components`\n(semantic tier) and `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) build on. Depends only on\n`@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, so any package can use it without pulling the GitHub-only\nupstream."
msgstr "`@pantoken/utils` — cúntóirí comhroinnte, saor ó upstream a úsáidtear ar fud na bpacáistí pantoken: an réititheoir tagartha token (le láimhseáil `light-dark()`), na dhá regex token (téipithe trí `arkregex`), kebab→camel case, anailís dathanna hex, slánú SVG, scála spáis pantoken, bailíochtú drift tagartha, agus na ginéaraí ginearálta token→utility-class ar bhunaitheann `@pantoken/components` (semantic tier) agus `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier). Ag brath amháin ar `@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, mar sin is féidir le haon phacáiste é a úsáid gan an upstream atá ar GitHub a tharraingt."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The css-tree-backed token syntax validator lives at the separate `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`\nentry, not this barrel — `css-tree` bundles a runtime `createRequire()` JSON load that breaks when\npulled into a browser/SSR bundle, and this barrel is imported by browser-facing packages (e.g.\n`@pantoken/components`) for the Node-free helpers above."
msgstr "Tá an seiceálaí sintáxis token tacaithe ag css-tree suite san iontráil ar leith `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`, ní sa barrel seo — cuireann `css-tree` luchtú JSON le `createRequire()` ag rith am a bhriseann nuair a tharraingtar isteach i mbailiúchán do bhrabhsálaí/SSR, agus iompórtáiltear an barrel seo ag pacáistí a bhfuil aghaidh ar bhrabhsálaithe orthu (m.sh. `@pantoken/components`) don chabhair thuas gan Node."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pure barrel — every implementation lives in its own discrete module; add new helpers there and\nre-export them here, don't grow this file."
msgstr "Baraille íon — tá gach cur i bhfeidhm ina mhodúl ar leith; cuir cúntóirí nua ansin agus easpórtáil iad arís anseo, ná méadaigh an comhad seo."

