#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "Sáraíonn sé an leagan ar leibhéal an soláthraí/tógála don chomhad seo amháin."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### raw?"
msgstr "### raw?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "Do sholáthraithe a athraíonn JS de réir réamhshocraithe (esm.sh): cuireann `false` ar chumas an tsoláthraí a ghnáth-iompú ESM a chur i bhfeidhm (riachtanach chun `import` pointe iontrála pacáiste i ndáiríre). Is é an réamhshocrú `true` — freagair an comhad mar atá é, riachtanach do shócmhainní réamhthógtha/neamh-ESM cosúil le bileoga CSS agus pacáistí IIFE."

