#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-deprecations` — lifecycle-aware compatibility shims for dropped upstream tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-deprecations` — shimanna comhoiriúnachta a bhfuil feas ar saolré acu do thochailtí upstream a thiteann."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When an upstream release drops a `--instui-*` token, a hand-authored `DeprecationLedger`\nrecords its lifecycle: when it was deprecated, the upstream minor that will remove it, and how to\nkeep it working meanwhile — either forward to a canonical token (`replacement` → `var(...)`) or\nfreeze its last-known literal (`value`). This plugin appends one shim token per entry. Because the\nshim is a single `var(...)` or a plain value, `defineToken` records its `refersTo`/syntax and\n`toCss` emits it, so the shim rides into css/scss/less/stylus/wordpress/vanilla with no extra wiring."
msgstr "Nuair a fhágann eisiúint upstream tochaile `--instui-*`, taifeadann `DeprecationLedger` scríofa de láimh a saolré:\nnuair a cuireadh i neamhrialtacht é, an minor upstream a rachaidh i bhfeidhm chun é a bhaint, agus conas é a choinneáil ag obair go dtí sin — nó a atreorú chuig toghán canónach (`replacement` → `var(...)`) nó a reo ina litir dheireanach ar eolas (`value`). Cuirfidh an breiseán seo shim tochaile aonair isteach in aghaidh iontrála. Toisc gur `var(...)` aonair é an shim nó gur luach réidh é, taifeadann `defineToken` a `refersTo`/sintéis agus astaíonn `toCss` é, mar sin téann an shim isteach i css/scss/less/stylus/wordpress/vanilla gan sreangú breise."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The retirement is enforced elsewhere (the upgrade pipeline hard-fails a bump once an entry's\n`removeIn` upstream minor is reached, forcing the entry to be retired and a consumer minor cut).\n[dueForRemoval](functions/dueForRemoval.md) is the check that powers it; [describeLifecycle](functions/describeLifecycle.md) powers the docs."
msgstr "Déantar an scoránaíocht a fhorghníomhú ailleurs (theastaíonn go n-easaíodh an uasdátú má shroicheann minor upstream an iontrála a luadh, ag brú an iontrála chun scoránaíochta agus ag gearradh minor do chustaiméara).\n[dueForRemoval](functions/dueForRemoval.md) is é an seiceál a chothaíonn é; [describeLifecycle](functions/describeLifecycle.md) is é an cumhacht a chuirtear sa doiciméad."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [deprecationShims](functions/deprecationShims.md)"
msgstr "Athainmníonn agus easpórtálann arís [deprecationShims](functions/deprecationShims.md)"

