msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-transition` — the `--instui-transition-duration`/`--instui-transition-timing`\ntokens behind InstUI's `Transition` utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-transition` — na `--instui-transition-duration`/`--instui-transition-timing`\ntóicní taobh thiar de uirlis `Transition` de chuid InstUI."

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS itself (the `.instui-transition` base rule plus the `fade`/`scale`/`slide-*` state classes)\nlives in `@pantoken/components`' own `transition` utility now; this plugin only bakes the two\nduration/timing tokens into a token IR for consumers using the lower-level `@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/tokens` pipeline directly."
msgstr "Tá an CSS féin (an riail bhunúsach `.instui-transition` agus na ranganna staid `fade`/`scale`/`slide-*`)\nsa `transition` uirlis atá ag `@pantoken/components` anois; ní chuireann an breiseán seo ach na\nbeirt tóicní fad/ama isteach i IR tóicní do thomhaltóirí a úsáideann an píblíne leibhéal-íos `@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/tokens` go díreach."

