msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI's layout primitives (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) take `withVisualDebug` to outline the box\nand its children while debugging a layout. This plugin emits a single dash-prefixed modifier,\n`-with-visual-debug`, that works on any element (compound with any base, e.g.\n`.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). The outline colour is a `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` custom property\n(default a bright magenta) so it's easy to retint."
msgstr "Tógann primitíopaí leagan amach InstUI (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) `withVisualDebug` chun cruthlíne a tharraingt timpeall an bhosca agus a leanaí agus tú ag dífhabhtú leagan amach. Seo breiseán a sheolann modhnóir amháin le réamhfhocal dash, `-with-visual-debug`, a oibríonn ar aon eilimint (m.sh. ilchodán le haon bhonn, `.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). Is airíonna saincheaptha `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` é dath an chréatlín (go réamhshocraithe magenta geal), mar sin tá sé éasca é a athdathú."

