#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# flatten-property"
msgstr "# flatten-property"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property\ndeclarations."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — déan rialacha @-`@property` a thiontú go fógraí airíonna-saincheaptha shimplí."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@property` at-rules register typed CSS custom properties with `syntax`, `inherits`, and\n`initial-value` descriptors. They carry significant byte overhead — ~60 bytes of boilerplate per\nproperty — and are unnecessary when the stylesheet is a self-contained bundle where type\nregistration provides no runtime benefit. This plugin replaces each `@property` block with a\nsimple `--name: value` declaration inside a chosen selector, recovering all that overhead."
msgstr "Cláraíonn rialacha @-`@property` airíonna saincheaptha CSS atá cineálaithe le cur síos `syntax`, `inherits`, agus\n`initial-value`. Iompraíonn siad ualach suntasach i baiti — thart ar 60 baiti d’ábhar caighdeánach in aghaidh an\nairíonna — agus níl siad riachtanach nuair atá an stíl-sheet ina bhundle féin-chuimsitheach nach dtairgeann clárú cineál\nsochar ag am rith. Cuireann an breiseán seo gach bloc `@property` in ionad le\nfógra simplí `--name: value` laistigh de roghnóir roghnaithe, ag aisghabháil an ualaigh sin."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Semantic note:** removing `@property` loses CSS type registration. Typed transitions/animations,\n`@starting-style`, and the CSS Typed OM depend on it. Only apply to bundles where those semantics\nare not needed."
msgstr "**Nóta seimeantach:** má bhaintear `@property` cailltear clárú cineál CSS. Braitheann trasnú/animáidí chineálaithe,\n`@starting-style`, agus an CSS Typed OM air. Níor chóir é a chur i bhfeidhm ach ar bhundleanna nach bhfuil na seimeantics sin\nriachtanach iontu."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: FlattenPropertyOptions"
msgstr "# Comhéadan: FlattenPropertyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."
msgstr "Roghanna do [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### injectSelector?"
msgstr "### injectSelector?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The selector of the rule that receives the extracted `--name: value` declarations."
msgstr "An roghnóir don riail a fhaigheann na fógraí `--name: value` a easpórtáladh."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Default Value"
msgstr "#### Luach Réamhshocraithe"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### onMissingInitialValue?"
msgstr "### onMissingInitialValue?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "What to do with an `@property` at-rule that has no `initial-value` descriptor."
msgstr "Cad atá le déanamh le at-rule `@property` nach bhfuil cur síos `initial-value` air."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"remove\"` — drop the at-rule (default).\n- `\"keep\"` — leave it in the output untouched."
msgstr "- `\"remove\"` — bain an at-riail (réamhshocraithe).\n- `\"keep\"` — fág é san aschur gan athrú."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: flattenProperty"
msgstr "# Athróg: flattenProperty"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the flatten-`@property` PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Cruthaigh an breiseán PostCSS flatten-`@property`."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Walks all `@property` at-rules in the stylesheet, extracts each `initial-value` descriptor, removes\nthe at-rule, and prepends a single `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` rule containing all\nextracted declarations. Empty rules and `@layer` blocks left behind after removal are dropped."
msgstr "Ritheann sé trí gach at-rule `@property` sa stíleáil, aistarraingíonn sé gach tuairisc `initial-value`, baintear an at-rule, agus cuirtear riail amháin `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` i bhforchéann a chuimsíonn na ráitis uile a aistarraingíodh.\nBaintear rialacha folmha agus bloic `@layer` a fhágtar tar éis an bhaint."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Default injection into :root**"
msgstr "**Ionchur réamhshocraithe isteach i :root**"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inject into :scope (for use inside scope blocks)**"
msgstr "**Ionchur isteach i :scope (le húsáid laistigh de bhlocaí :scope)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# mangle-custom-props"
msgstr "# mangle-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names to minimal sequential\nidentifiers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — athainmniú ainmneacha fada maoine shaincheaptha go haitheantóirí sraitheacha íosta."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-readable but expensive in\nminified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, every `var()` call,\nand every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name — across definitions,\n`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr "Tá ainmneacha token cosúil le `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` inléite do dhaoine ach costasach i bpacáistí mínithe: is é an t-ainm féin 40+ baiti, athráite sa sainmhíniú, i ngach glao `var()`, agus i ngach clárú `@property`. Cuireann an breiseán seo ionad le gach ainm a mheaitseálann — trasna shainmhínithe, tagairtí `var()`, agus paraiméadair `@property` — le haitheantóir íosta (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`, …), ag laghdú an t-ualach ainmneacha thart ar 90%."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a deterministic mapping,\nthen assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets multiple\nseparate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately processed CSS files that will\nbe loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr "Bailítear na hainmneacha ón bhfolioige stíle iomlán, cuireadh iad in ord aibítre chun mapeáil dheimhnithe a bhaint amach, agus ansin ceapadh iad go sraitheach. Ligeann rogha [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) do iliomad pasanna PostCSS ar leith léaráid chonsistéanta a roinnt, ionas gur féidir comhaid CSS a próiseáladh go neamhspleách ach a luchtófar le chéile a mhionrú go sábháilte leis na hainmneacha céanna."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: MangleCustomPropsOptions"
msgstr "# Comhéadan: MangleCustomPropsOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Roghanna do [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "Ní rachadh i mbunmeaitliú ach ainmneacha airíonna saincheaptha a thosaíonn leis an sreang seo."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### method?"
msgstr "### method?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "An algartam a úsáidtear chun ainmneacha ionadacha giorra a ghiniúint."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; shortest for large sets)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alphanumeric)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (réamhshocraithe; is giorra do shraithí móra)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alfa-uimhríoch)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### propertyMap?"
msgstr "### propertyMap?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after processing.\nThe message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr "Nuair a `true`, cuireann sé iontráil `mangle-map` chuig PostCSS `result.messages` tar éis próiseála.\nTá cruth an teachtaire: `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### sharedManifest?"
msgstr "### sharedManifest?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "Is `Map` inathraithe é a roinntear thar il-pasanna PostCSS."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) and writes new\nones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same `Map` instance to\nevery `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files which will be\nloaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical name mapping."
msgstr "Ar gach pas léann an breiseán na hiontrálacha atá ann (ag athúsáid a n-ainmneacha giorra) agus scríobhann sé iontrálacha nua (ag leanúint den chomptóir ó `sharedManifest.size`). Pas an t‑institiúid `Map` chéanna chuig gach glao `mangleCustomProps` nó `applyMinify` a phróiseálann comhaid CSS a luchtófar le chéile sa bhrabhsálaí — cinnteoidh sé seo go n-úsáideann gach comhad léaráid ainmne ceannacúil chéanna."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest before the component\nsheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr "Próiseáil an bhileog token ar dtús ionas go seadfar a hainmneacha isteach sa manifest sula gcuirfidh bileoga comhpháirte a n-tagairtí (de ghnáth ag trasnú) leis."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Type Alias: MangleMethod"
msgstr "# Alias Cineál: MangleMethod"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Straitéis ghiniúna ainm ghearr le haghaidh [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: mangleCustomProps"
msgstr "# Athróg: mangleCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Cruthaigh an breiseán PostCSS mangle-custom-properties."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, `var()` references,\nand `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, deterministic mapping, then\nassigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr "Bhailíonn sé gach ainm airíonna saincheaptha a thagann le `prefix` ó airíonna ráite, tagairtí `var()`,\nagus paraiméadair `@property`. Sórtálann sé iad de réir aibítre le haghaidh léarscáil chobhsaí, chinneadhchomhfhreagrach, ansin\ncuireann sé ainmneacha giorra orthu ag úsáid an `method` roghnaithe. Cuireann sé in áit gach tarlú ar fud an stíleálaillín."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**Mangle le réamhshocruithe (--instui-\\\\*, base26)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**Roinn an léarscáil trasna dhá chomhad a luchtítear le chéile**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"
msgstr "**Úsáid ainmneacha base36 agus seol an léarscáil trí result.messages**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: applyMinify()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: applyMinify()"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "Cuir tiontuithe mionaithe airíonna saincheaptha i bhfeidhm ar shreang stíle."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. Plugin order:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the input unchanged when\nno options are set."
msgstr "Tógann sé eagar breiseán PostCSS ó `options` agus ritheann sé é go sioncrónach. Ord na mbriseán:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Filleann sé an ionchur gan athrú nuair nach bhfuil aon roghanna socraithe."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stylesheet string to transform."
msgstr "An sreang stíle le tiontú."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "An sreang CSS tiontaithe."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr "# props-minify"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — comhdhéanamh athruithe prúnaigh, réidhigh, agus mangail do\n`--instui-*` airíonna saincheaptha trí uirlis aonair [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "Úsáideann gach píplíne a ghineann CSS (scripteanna gineála, rendairí) `applyMinify` chun dromchla mionaithe comhsheasmhach a sholáthar gan spleáchas PostCSS díreach."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**Tá Prúnaigh + Mangail oiriúnach amháin do phacáistí féinlonnaithe** áit a gcónaíonn na tagairtí `var(--instui-*)` go léir agus a sainmhínithe sa tháirgeadh céanna. Do thomhaltóirí comhaid ar leith (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` luchtaithe go neamhspleách), cuir i bhfeidhm `{ flatten: true }` amháin."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**Mangail trasna teorainneacha comhaid:** pas an t‑sampla céanna `Map` mar\n`mangle.sharedManifest` chuig gach glao `applyMinify` a phróiseálann comhaid CSS a luchtaítear le chéile.\nPróiseáil an bhileog token ar dtús (síolann sí an manifest), ansin bileoga comhpháirte."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Cuir na trí athrú uile i bhfeidhm ar phacáiste féinlonnaithe**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Réidh amháin (sábháilte do thomhaltóirí comhaid ar leith)**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**Mangail dhá chomhad leis an mapa céanna**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: PropsMinifyOptions"
msgstr "# Comhéadan: PropsMinifyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "Roghanna do [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prune?"
msgstr "### prune?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr "Cuir i bhfeidhm [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) chun thóicní `--instui-*` neamhúsáidte a ‘tree-shake’ sula ndéantar aistrithe eile."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and the component\nrules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr "Sábháilte amháin do bhailiúcháin neamhspleácha a bhfuil sainmhínithe thóicní agus na rialacha comhaid a luaitear iontu araon. Bainfidh pruning bileog atá díreach le thóicní gach rud as."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### flatten?"
msgstr "### flatten?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert `@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr "Cuir i bhfeidhm [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) chun rialacha at-`@property` a thiontú go fhoirmlí shimplí."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "`true` úsáideann réamhshocruithe an phlugaín (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`). Déan pasáil ar réad [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) chun na réamhshocruithe aonair a shárú."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### mangle?"
msgstr "### mangle?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long `--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr "Cuir i bhfeidhm [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) chun hainmneacha fada `--instui-*` a mhalartú le haitheantóirí íosta."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr "`true` úsáideann réamhshocruithe an phlugaín (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`). Déan pasáil ar réad [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) chun na réamhshocruithe aonair a shárú — lena n-áirítear `sharedManifest` le haghaidh comordú tras‑comhaid."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
msgstr "Sábháilte amháin do bhailiúcháin neamhspleácha. Féach na doiciméid ar leibhéal an mhodúil."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: pruneCustomProps"
msgstr "# Athróg: pruneCustomProps"

