#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "During development, changes to a local workspace package normally need a manual rebuild before the\ndev server reflects them. This plugin automates that: it watches each upstream package's source\nwith native `fs.watch` (not Vite's chokidar, which filters paths outside the project root),\ndebounces rapid changes, rebuilds in topological order, and registers built output with Vite's\nwatcher so the browser reloads. In pantoken's docs it keeps the generated CSS (`@pantoken/css`,\n`@pantoken/components`) fresh as you edit the libraries, instead of only at build time."
msgstr "Le linn forbartha, de ghnáth iarrann athruithe ar phacáiste áitiúil sa spás oibre athtógáil láimhe sula bhfeictear iad ar an\nfreastalaí forbartha. Déanann an breiseán sin sin go huathoibríoch: féachann sé ar fhoinsí gach pacáiste upstream\nle `fs.watch` dúchais (ní le chokidar Vite, a scagann bealaí lasmuigh de root an tionscadail),\ncuireann sé moill ar athruithe tapa, atógann sé iad i ord topolaíoch, agus cláraíonn sé an t-aschur tógtha leis an bhféachadóir de chuid Vite\nionas go ndéanann an brabhsálaí athluchtú. I ndoiciméid pantoken coinníonn sé an CSS ginte (`@pantoken/css`,\n`@pantoken/components`) úrnuach agus tú ag eagarthóireacht na leabharlann, seachas ach ag am tógála."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It applies during `serve` only, so production builds are untouched."
msgstr "Tá sé le cur i bhfeidhm le linn `serve` amháin, mar sin ní bhíonn tionchar air ar thógálacha táirgeachta."

