msgid "`@pantoken/foundation` — theme Foundation for Sites with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — téama Foundation for Sites le tóicíní Instructure."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Tá Foundation bunaithe ar Sass, mar sin seolann an pacáiste seo dhá sraith. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) gineann páirteach Sass i stíl `_settings` a chuireann athróga socruithe Foundation ag `var(--instui-*)`, ionas go ndéanann tógáil Sass an cuma Instructure a chomhiomlánú agus go gcoinnítear téamú am-reatha trí na haitheantóirí céanna saincheaptha. Gineann [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) datha tanaí CSS a théamaíonn na ranganna comhdhéanta coitianta (`.button`, `.callout`, nascanna) sa chaoi chéanna — úsáideach nuair a itheann tú CSS Foundation stoc agus má tá tú ag iarraidh dathanna Instructure a shraithú air gan athchomhiomlánú."

