#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# markdown-it"
msgstr "# markdown-it"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — a markdown-it plugin that renders `:icon:` codes as inline SVG and\nstandalone color values (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) as swatches, using the pantoken icon\nset."
msgstr "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — breiseán markdown-it a dhéanann `:icon:` códanna a léiriú mar SVG inline agus\nluachanna dathanna neamhspleácha (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) mar samplaí datha, ag úsáid tacair siombailí pantoken."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ports the `@pantoken/rehype` and `@pantoken/react-markdown` pipelines onto markdown-it: a\nsingle core rule walks each inline token's text children, splits them on the icon and color\npatterns, and swaps the matches for `html_inline` tokens. Icon codes resolve through a chain —\nplugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve), then the\nbuilt-in `@pantoken/icons` set — so brand-icon plugins compose the same way they do elsewhere."
msgstr "Tá sé ag iompórtáil na bpróiseálacha `@pantoken/rehype` agus `@pantoken/react-markdown` go markdown-it: siúlann riail chroí aonair trí gach páiste téacs inline, iad a roinnt ar na patrúin íocón agus dath, agus na comhréitigh a mhalartú le haghaidh tósaitheoirí `html_inline`. Réitíonn cóid íocón trí slí — réititheoirí breiseán `rehype` ar dtús, ansin [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve) shonrach, agus ansin an tacar ionsuite `@pantoken/icons` — mar sin comhdhéanann breiseáin íocón branda an bealach céanna agus a dhéanann siad áit ar bith eile."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The emitted markup uses the same class names as the other renderers (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), so loading `@pantoken/components` styles it. Wrap the rendered HTML in a\n`.pantoken-prose` container (see [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) to pick up the prose layer too."
msgstr "Úsáideann an marcáil a ghintear na hainmneacha ranga céanna agus na sreabhthreoracha eile (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), mar sin déanann luchtú `@pantoken/components` stíliú air. Cuir an HTML a rinneadh timpeall i gcoimeádán `.pantoken-prose` (féach [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) chun an sraith próis a ghabháil freisin."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
