msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# pendo"
msgstr "# pendo"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — stíleolaí domhanda i stíl Instructure do threoracha Pendo."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
msgstr "Pendo insteallann HTML threorach isteach i leathanach óstach; seo a thaispeánann DOM an threora sin (`._pendo-*`) chun comhfhreagras a dhéanamh le Instructure UI, ag úsáid sraithe token `--instui-*` de pantoken le haghaidh ailínithe. Cuimsíonn sé cóireálacha threoracha bratacha violeta agus mara atá freagrach in éineacht le foláirimh, popovers, suirbhéanna agus rialuithe. Tá CSS an chomhpháirte portáilte ó `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; soláthraíonn pantoken na tóicíní agus an tionól. Gníomhachtaíonn aicme téama amháin ina bhfuil `instui` an stíleolaí scóipthe; roghnaíonn sí suffixanna comhbhrúite ar an aicme sin dathanna na mbratach agus na deilbhíní."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) comhdhéanann an stíleolaí; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is é an tógáil `rebrand` réidh (scóipthe, `!important`). Foilsítear comhad statach ag `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"
msgstr "Athainmníonn agus easpórtálann arís [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"

