msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### important?"
msgstr "### important?"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "Cuir `!important` le fógraí comhpháirte ionas go sáróidh siad stíleanna Pendo (réamhshocrú `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Bain triail ar an gcrann chun na ticéid `--instui-*` nach n-úsáidtear a bhaint (réamhshocrú `true`; má tá sé as, seoltar an tacar iomlán ticéad)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Tiontaigh rialacha at-`@property` go fógraí simplí airíonna-saincheaptha trí\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (réamhshocrú `false`). Úsáideann `true` réamhshocruithe an phlaistigh le\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` ionas go mbeidh na fógraí laistigh den bhloc `@scope`.\nSeol réad [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) chun na réamhshocruithe aonair a shárú."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Athraigh ainmneacha `--instui-*` go haitheantóirí íosta bunaithe ar bhunús-26 trí [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(réamhshocrú `false`). Tá sé seo sábháilte anseo mar is pacáiste neamhspleách é an tacar iomlán ticéad + bileog stíle comhpháirte. Seol réad [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) chun na réamhshocruithe a shárú."

