msgid "The plugin walks hast text nodes and replaces `:code:` tokens with an inline SVG element,\nresolving each code through a chain: plugin `rehype` resolvers first, then any explicit\n`resolve`, then the built-in `@pantoken/icons` set. It ports `rehype-instui-markdown` onto the\nshared icon manifest."
msgstr "Siúlann an breiseán trí nóid téacs HAST agus cuireann sé in ionad na dtáicne `:code:` le heilimint SVG inlíne, ag réiteach gach cód trí shlabhra: réititheoirí `rehype` an bhreiseáin ar dtús, ansin aon `resolve` sainmhínithe, agus ina dhiaidh sin tacar `@pantoken/icons` ionsuite. Cuireann sé `rehype-instui-markdown` ar an liosta siombailí roinnte."

