msgstr "Páirteanna nochtaithe Shadow-DOM (`::part(name)`), ó `@csspart` nó roghnóir `::part()`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
