#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Design tokens this component consumes: every `--*` custom property referenced via `var(...)` inside\nits rules, each annotated with `@tokens` prose where authored (and including any `@tokens`-declared\ntoken not literally found via `var()`)."
msgstr "Taispeántais dearaidh a úsáideann an comhpháirt seo: gach `--*` airíonna saincheaptha a luaitear trí `var(...)` laistigh\na a rialacha, gach ceann mionathraithe le haistriúchán `@tokens` ina scríobhadh é (agus lena n-áirítear aon thaispeántas d’ainm `@tokens` nach bhfuil go litriúil le fáil trí `var()`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cssPropertiesDeclared"
msgstr "### cssPropertiesDeclared"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom properties this component declares (`@property`) or documents (`@cssproperty`)."
msgstr "Airíonna saincheaptha a fhógraíonn an chomhpháirt seo (`@property`) nó a dhoiciméadaítear (`@cssproperty`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
