msgstr "Feidhmeanna saincheaptha CSS (`@function`) a shainmhíníonn an comhpháirt seo."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### animations"
msgstr "### animations"

