#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: buildRegisterContext()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: buildRegisterContext()"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the shared [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) a `register()`-style call threads to every element's\n`define`. The icon resolver is injectable: `register()` always passes the real,\n`@pantoken/icons`-backed [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) (unchanged default behavior for every existing caller),\nwhile the per-element CDN build passes [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) for elements that never call it —\n`@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` is a multi-MB dependency, and since Rollup can't code-split\n`iife`/`umd` output, anything statically reachable from a bundle's entry ends up in the whole\nbundle, regardless of whether that specific element's code path ever invokes it. This module has no\ntop-level side effects for exactly that reason — importing it (unlike importing `../index.ts`, which\nauto-registers everything on import) never reaches [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) unless the caller passes it in."
msgstr "Tóg an [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) comónta mar ghlao stíl `register()` a shreafaíonn chuig `define` gach eilimint. Tá an réiteachán deicrithe in-insteallaithe: seachadann `register()` i gcónaí an [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) fíor, atá tacaithe ag `@pantoken/icons` ( iompar réamhshocraithe gan athrú do gach glaonna atá ann cheana), agus seachadann an t-athrú CDN in aghaidh-eilimint an [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) do eilimintí nach nglaonn air riamh — is spleáchas il-MB é `@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens`, agus ós rud é nach féidir le Rollup spléagar cód a dhéanamh ar thorthaí `iife`/`umd`, téann aon rud atá go statúil inmhianaithe ó ionchur bailiúcháin isteach san iomlán\nbhailiúchán, beag beann ar cibé an nglaonn bealach cód na heilimint sin air riamh nó nach nglaonn. Níl éifeachtaí taobh-ardchéime ag an módule seo de chinntí díreach mar sin — ní shroicheann a iomportáil (in aghaidh a iompar `../index.ts`, a chláraíonn gach rud go huathoibríoch ar iomportáil) [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) mura dtugann an glaoiteoir é isteach."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Same shape as `register()`'s options, minus `only`."
msgstr "An cruth céanna agus roghanna `register()`, gan `only`."

