#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The resolver wired into `ctx.iconSvg` — pass [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) for real icons\n  or [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) when the caller's element set provably never renders one (see\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` in `./elements-meta.ts`)."
msgstr "An réiteachán atá sreangaithe isteach i `ctx.iconSvg` — pas [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) má tá íocóin fhíor uait\n  nó [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) nuair a thaispeánann tacar eilimint an glaoiteora nach ndéanann íocón a chur i láthair go cinnte (féach `ICON_ELEMENTS` in `./elements-meta.ts`)."

