msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap `value` in Unicode bidi isolates (FSI/PDI) so it doesn't scramble the surrounding text's\ndirection — e.g. a Latin filename embedded in an Arabic sentence built with plain string\nconcatenation. `formatMessage` already does this for MF2 placeholders; use `isolate` only when\ninterpolating outside MF2."
msgstr "Clúdaigh `value` i aonairí bidi Unicode (FSI/PDI) ionas nach ndéanfaidh sé mearbhall ar threoshuíomh an téacs thart air\ndirection — m.sh. ainm comhaid Laidineach a cuireadh i mbun abairt Araibise a tógadh le sraithe téacs shimplí\nconcatenation. Déanann `formatMessage` é seo cheana do phláisiúirí MF2; bain úsáid as `isolate` amháin nuair atá tú\nag idirghrúthú lasmuigh de MF2."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/makeStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: makeStrings()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: makeStrings()"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/makeStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a `WebComponentStrings` object for `locale`.\nWeekday names are derived from `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (and rotated to the locale's first day of\nweek); all other strings fall back to English unless provided in `overrides`."
msgstr "Tóg réad `WebComponentStrings` do `locale`.\nBaintear ainmneacha laethanta na seachtaine ó `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (agus rothlaítear iad chun an chéad lá den\nseachtain sa láthair a léiriú); fillfidh gach téacs eile ar an mBéarla mura soláthraítear iad i `overrides`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/noopIconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: noopIconSvg()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: noopIconSvg()"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/noopIconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)-shaped resolver that never resolves anything — for elements that don't need it."
msgstr "Réititheoir i gcruth [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) nach réitíonn aon rud riamh — do eilimintí nach bhfuil gá leo."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Glacann sé le [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) ailínithe go hiomlán *nó* sreang lipéid BCP47 amh. Nuair a arna\npasáil mar shreang, bainfidh [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) ainmneacha laethanta na seachtaine trí `Intl.DateTimeFormat` agus beidh\nna sreanga eile ar ais chuig an mBéarla; pasáil bundle le haghaidh aistriúcháin iomlána."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "Réad [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md), nó lipéad BCP47 (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/resolveFirstDay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: resolveFirstDay()"
msgstr "# Feidhm: resolveFirstDay()"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/resolveFirstDay.md
