msgstr "Lá an chéad seachtaine mar innéacs JS `Date.getDay()` (0=Dé Domhnaigh … 6=Dé Sathairn)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# web-components"
msgstr "# web-components"

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/web-components` — framework-agnostic custom elements for Instructure UI."
msgstr "`@pantoken/web-components` — eilimintí saincheaptha neamhspleácha ar fhráma le haghaidh Instructure UI."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[register](functions/register.md) (auto-invoked in the browser) defines the full `<instui-*>` element set into\nany custom-element registry. Each element renders the matching `@pantoken/components` CSS into\nits shadow root; tokens are inherited custom properties that pierce the shadow boundary — load\n`@pantoken/css` to supply them."
msgstr "[register](functions/register.md) (glaoite go huathoibríoch sa bhrabhsálaí) leagann sraith iomlán an eilimint `<instui-*>` isteach i\nngach clár-clár eilimint shaincheaptha. Léiríonn gach eilimint an CSS comhfhreagrach `@pantoken/components` ina\nfhréamh scáthála; is airíonna saincheaptha anónta iad na tógair a oireann trí theorainn an scátháin — luchtú\n`@pantoken/css` chun iad a sholáthar."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For localized UI strings (calendar nav labels, date-input placeholder, drilldown Back text) pass\n`locale`, `strings`, or `dir` options to [register](functions/register.md). The full Canvas-parity bundle set and\nthe [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper are exported from this package as well."
msgstr "Chun sreanga UI áitiúla a sholáthar (lipéid nascleanúna féilire, ionchur-dáta seasamlíne, téacs 'Back' drilldown) pasáil\nroghanna `locale`, `strings`, nó `dir` chuig [register](functions/register.md). Tá an tacar iomlán pacáiste comhiomlánais Canvas agus\naidmhí [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) easpóirtithe ón bpacáiste seo freisin."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The module is Node-safe: element classes are defined inside [register](functions/register.md), a no-op when there\nis no DOM, so importing during SSR or a build never touches `HTMLElement`."
msgstr "Tá an modúl sábháilte do Node: déanann ranganna eilimintí a sainmhíniú taobh istigh de [register](functions/register.md), gníomh ná-níl nuair nach bhfuil DOM ann, mar sin ní bhaineann aon iompair le linn SSR nó tógála riamh `HTMLElement`."

