msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The localized wordmark's language, if a translated variant is wanted."
msgstr "Teanga an mharcfhocail áitiúil, má tá leagan aistrithe uait."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The localized wordmark's language, absent for the default (English) variant."
msgstr "Teanga an mharcfhocail áitiúil; níl sí i láthair don éagsúlacht réamhshocraithe (Béarla)."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A trailing language code on a localized wordmark variant, e.g. `\"horizontal-full-color-ar\"`."
msgstr "Cóid teanga ag an deireadh ar éagsúlacht mharca focal áitiúil, m.sh. `\"horizontal-full-color-ar\"`."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "BCP47 locale tag or a pre-built [LocaleBundle](#). When set, uses `registerLocalized`."
msgstr "Lipéad réigiúnach BCP47 nó [LocaleBundle](#) réamhthógtha. Nuair atá sé socraithe, úsáideann `registerLocalized`."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](#) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](#) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Glacann sé le [LocaleBundle](#) réitithe go hiomlán *nó* le sreang chlib BCP47 amh. Nuair a chuirtear sreang isteach, baintear ainmneacha laethanta na seachtaine as trí [makeStrings](#) ag úsáid `Intl.DateTimeFormat` agus filleann na téacsanna eile ar Bhéarla; seachad bundle le haghaidh aistriúcháin iomlána."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](#) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "Réada [LocaleBundle](#), nó clib BCP47 (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
